grantha <372> ||

yeṇānūṇāṃsthagitamamalaṃ dṛkkrisākhyaṃ svarūpaṃ |
yat sadbhāvād bhavajalanidhau jantu jātasya yātaḥ ||

durvārantatkṣapayati tamo yat praśādāstamīśaṃ |
matvāsāṣaṃ puramathanaṃ likhyate tvagnikāryaḥ ||

sarvadravya sahāyādyāyāhomaṃ kartamicchati |
mā'visṛjya śivaṃ bhaktyā kṛtāṣṭāṅgaṃ matiḥ paraṃ ājñā me dīpatāṃ 
nātha agnikāryaṃ karomyahaṃ |

adhyeṇyaivaṃ sārghapātraṃ upagamya pradakṣiṇaṃ |
homāpayogavastūni paśyanagni diśi sthitaṃ ||

saṃskuryādvidhivargeṇa sūttarāsyārcane yathā |
caṇḍarasraṃ bhavetacca vṛttaṃ vāhasta sammitaṃ ||

nitya naimittike caiva kāmye kalpa pracoditaṃ |

<25b>

iṣṭakābhiḥ supakṣābhirapakṣābhiramambhavāt ||

kuryāt kuṇḍaṃ tu śāstroktaṃ pañcatryeka sumekhalaṃ |
ṣaṭpañcābdi triyakṣaistu pañcasyuḥ kuṇḍamekhalāḥ ||

triśro vedāgni netrairvā ṣaḍbhirekāṅgulairbhavet |
tatra mūlena śivatejo vṛṃhita cakṣuṣānirīkṣaṇaṃ ||

hūṁ phaḍantāstreṇa prokṣaṇa ḍāḍane |
vauṣaḍantavarmaṇā vaḍaḍantena vābhyukṣaṇaṃ ||

astreṇa khananau dvāro hṛdāpūraṇasamīkaraṇai |
vauṣaḍantavarmaṇā vā secanaṃ astreṇa kūṭanaṃ || 

varmaṇāṃ saṃmārjano pare pane | 

oṃ hauṃ śāntyatītāyai namaḥ | madhye | 
oṃ hyaiṃ śāntyai namaḥ | purve | 
oṃ hrūṁ vidyāyai namaḥ | yāmyai ||
oṃ hrīṃ pratiṣṭhāyai namaḥ | saumye || 
oṃ hlāṁ nivṛtyai namaḥ | paścime ||

kalāmaya kalpanaṃ puṣpaiḥ || varmaṇā triḥsūtrī veṣṭanaṃ |

oṃ hāṁ kalāmaya kuṇḍāya namaḥ | pūjanaṃ ||

astreṇa kuśāgreṇottarāgrarekhātraya pūrvāmraika rekhākaraṇaṃ vānyathā ||

<26a>

astreṇa vajrākārakuśatrayeṇa vajrīkaraṇaṃ |
hṛdāpūrvottarāgrakuśadvayeṇa catuspathaṃ ||

ete aṣṭādaśasaṃskārāmūlahṛdasthauṃ kāraṇa vā ||

varmaṇā kuśaiḥ kuṇḍakaṇṭha catuṣṭhaye kāṇḍa paṭ ||

oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvarī vāgeśvarāyanāya namaḥ |
kuṇḍamadhye viṣṭaraṃ nyasya | oṃ hauṃ vāgeśvaryai namaḥ || 

oṃ hauṁ vāgīśvarāya namaḥ | abhyarcanaṃ || vāgīsā vāhanaṃ na vā | yadāha 
śrīkṣemarājaḥ || 

ataḥ pūrṇāhāntāparamasamāsvāda suhitaḥ | śivādeśādvācaṃ 
śivarasaparonmukhya subhagāṃ svavīryeṇā kramya pravara gururagnyādi nikhilaṃ | 
śivaikāt sātmadyuti mayamayaṃ saṃjanayati ||

athāraṇī sūryanta dvija gṛhādi saṃbhūta satpātrastha vahnerastreṇāṅgāra 
khaṇḍaṃ nismāryavīkṣādi śuddhaṃ ||

<26b>

oṃ hāṁ haṁ hāṁ vahni mūrtaye namaḥ | bhūtāgni mudgamitārābhaṃ gṛhītvā 
pūrakeva vindvagninā yatadarkābhaṃ kumbhakena nābhyagninā bhūyo madhyāhna 
sūryoyamamūttiṣṭhantaṃ bindunāṃ sahekī kṛtya |

oṃ hrūṁ vahni caityanyāya namaḥ | recakena dakṣanāḍyā bhramyatprabhaṃ 
niḥbhāryāgni pātre nidhāya ṣaḍaṅgenā mantryaguṇṭhanādi trayaṅkṛtvā | oṃ 
hāṁ agnaye namaḥ | sampūjya hastābhyāmādāya bhūmiṣṭhajānu 
kuṇṭhoparipradakṣiṇaṇayoni kṣobhe tribhrāmayitvā vāgī saumyāmāvīśāna 
diksiraseṣu vānau vṛṣasyantā vāsannacaramadhā tu samyātau sañcitya | oṃ hāṁ 
śiva bījāya namaḥ | vāgeśī garbhanāḍyāṃ vāgīśena 
patyābījamivakṣipyamāṇaṃ vibhādhyātmasaṃmukhaṃ kṣipet |

tato hṛde tastato gatabījasya nābhau kuṭīkaraṇaṃ paridhānasaṃvaraṇañca |

<27a>

oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvaryai svadhā | saucācamane ||

varmanā kāṣṭhairācchādya vyajanena prakṣālya || 

oṃ hāṃ garbhāgnaye namaḥ | pūjanaṃ ||

astreṇa bījayedvā'gni mantre naiva tu pūjayet |
saptāstra japtakuśakaṅkaṇaṃ vadvā garbhopadrava nāśaya putrātpatyarthañca 
vāgīśī dakṣakare ||

sadyena sampūjya svāhānta hṛdāhuti pañcaka dadyāti garbhādhānaṃ prathame 
māsi ||

vāmenābhyarcya śirasā hutvā || 

oṃ hāṁ puṁ puryaṣṭaka dehāya namaḥ |

kuśena jīvabhūtajalabindundadyāditi puṃśravanaṃ ||

tṛtīye ghore neṣṭvā śikhapārvayavavibhāga vaktra kalpanā 
ghāṭananiskṛtyarthaṃ viṃśatyāhutīrdadyāt ||

pūrvamadhyāparānvahnestrambhagāndhārtha kalpayet |
mukha kṛtyādadeśe tu tritatvāhutibhiḥ kramāditi sīmanto nayanaṃ ṣaṣṭhe ||

<27b>

puṃsāsaṃpūjyavarmaṇā hutvā kuśairagniṃ sa (***)(?) 
sadyasūtakanāśāmāstreṇa sa vāhyābhyantaraṃ kuṇḍasaḥ prokṣyarvāgasīṃtyakta 
kuśakaṅkanāṃ snātālaṃ kṛtāṃ dhyātvā hṛdābhyarcya |

lālāpanodanāya hūṁ phaḍantāstreṇa svāhāntena ka'rannimātrā 
ghṛtāktāgramūlāḥ samūlāgrā vā pañcamamidho hutvā |

hūṁ phaḍantāstreṇa pūrvottarāgrakuśātkuṇḍacaturdikṣu datvā tadupari varmaṇā 
paridhi viṣṭarau nyaset |

tathā hi ||

triṃśadarbhadalairgāḍhaṃ granthitā vāhu mātrakāḥ |
veṇikā vartulā vāpi vistarāvidbhitāḥ kuśaiḥ ||

tanmānāmajacaḥ sādrāḥ satpalāsalatodbhavāḥ |
jeṣṭhāṅguli parīṇāhā smṛtāḥ paridhayaḥ sadāḥ ||

tataḥ paridheṣu || oṃ hāṁ brahmaṇe namaḥ | pūrve ||

oṃ hāṁ viṣṇave namaḥ | paścime || 
oṃ hāṁ śaṃkarāya namaḥ | yāmye ||

<28a>

oṃ hāṁ anantāya namaḥ | saumye ||

viṣṭareṣu prāgādyuttaronta catudikṣustrentadbahirvāyu vādīśāntaṃ 
candrādīśāśānāntāragnirāmukhānaṣṭau lokapālā |

brahmaviṣṇaveśāna nai(-)rtaditsthau hṛdā | kuṇḍayāmye paridhi vāhye 
suṣkagomaya nyasta kuśa vistare |

oṃ hāṁ brahmaṇe yajñādhipataye namaḥ | tathottaradiśi sakuśapavitrajalapurṇā 
praṇītāyāṃ | oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave yajñāri sūdanāya namaḥ | sampūjya | bho bho 
lokapālā śivājñayā vi (*)(?) ṣṭhāṃ nivāyyaiṇamagnikumāraṃ rakṣateti 
śrāvayet | śruksruvau vyaṅgādi doṣahīnau śakti śivarūpau vīkṣādi śuddhau 
sakkuśau hastābhyāṃ saṅgṛhya hṛdāgnau kāṣṭhatvanirāsāya 
triḥpratāpyakuśamūlamadhyāgraiḥ tayormūlamadhyāgrānastreṇollikhyate 
svātmavidyāśivāṃ sādhiyānmuktyarthaṃ nyasya | śaktiṃ śruci śivaṃ 
śruvebhyacya varmaṇā trimūtryā kuśena vāsaṃ veṣṭāsvadakṣe 
kuśopariddhyartha mūrdhādho mukhau tau nipāyaḥ | kāpilaṃ ghṛtaṃ vastra 
śrutaṃ tāmrādi pātrasthaṃ catuśuddhaṃmādāyānmānaṃ brahmarūpaṃ vicintya 
| pradakṣiṇena hṛdākuṇḍopari trirbhāmyayitvā kuṇḍāgni koṇe dhṛtvā ||

oṃ hāṁ brahmaṇe svāhā ||

kuśāgreṇa ghṛtabinduṃ vahnai kṣipediti tāpanaṃ |
viṣṇurūpaṃmātmānaṃ vibhāvyase dhṛtvā ||

oṃ hīṁ viṣṇave svāhā | tathā kṣipedityadhiśrayaṇaṃ | kuṇḍanābhau 
dhṛtvātmānaṃ rudrarūpaṃ dhyātvā | oṃ hūṁ rudrāya svāhā | tata 
kṣipe'dityuśanaṃ | adhiśrayanānte vā tridhyaghṛtamātrabhrāmanaṃ kuṇḍe | tato 
madhya brahmagranthi prādeśamāraktasamaṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃmādāya 
svāhāntavarmaṇā kṣālānmukhaṃ trikṣiptvā punaḥ tathaivā 
pareṇātmamanmakhaṃ svāhānta hṛdākṣipedityutplavaṃ saṃplavau ||

hṛdājye kuśolmukaṃ kṣiptvā vahnau kṣipediti pavitrīkaraṇaṃ ||

<29a>

varmaṇādīptakuśinanirmathyaṃ vahnau tatkuśaṃ kṣipeditinīnāṃjanaṃ |

astreṇa dīptakuśena prakāsyāgnau kṣipedityudyotanaṃ |

hṛdāprādeśamāne madhyagranthikuśaṃ mayyai kṣiptvāṃṇḍalukṛṣṇapakṣau 
dakṣavāmamapyakrameṇa piṅgadāsuṣumnānāḍī trayaṃ ca smṛtvā savyabhāge 
śruvenā hyamādāya | 

oṃ hāṁ agnaye svāhā | agnidakṣanetrahātatraiva ghṛta | oṃ hāṁ somāya svāhā 
| vāmanetre | hāvāmaghṛte | oṃ hāṁ agnī somābhyāṃ svāhā | madhyanetre | 
hāmadhya smṛte | oṃ hāṁ agnaye sviṣṭa kṛtai svāhā | agnimukha | 
hābhāgatraye || iti śuklapakṣe || 

kṛṣṇapakṣe tu vāmasevya krameṇa || oṃ hāṁ somāya | oṃ hāṁ agnaye | oṃ 
hāṁ somāgnibhyāṃ | oṃ hāṁ agnaye sviṣṭa kṛte | iti prāgvat svetiheti yuktaḥ 
kramaḥ | śrīmṛgendrottare śrīsvacchandai tvanyathā yathā ||

<29b>

śuklapakṣavidhi hyevaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣe nyathā bhavet | 
somabhāge bhavet sūryo hyagni saṃjñā tu pūrvavat || 

agne sūryasya madhye tu āhutimprati pādayet | 
yataḥ sūryasya madhye tu amāvāsyāṃ śaśi viśet |

atha ṣaḍaṅgenāṃ vāhyeṣā mantrya guṇṭhanādau hṛdā tadvindu kṣepādanya 
sarpyāsmapyā sādhyaśruvenājyamādāya | oṃ haṁ sadyojātāya svāhā || oṃ hiṁ 
vāmadevāya svāhā || oṃ huṁ aghorāya svāhā | oṃ hyaṁ tatpuruṣāya svāhā | oṃ 
hāṁ īśānāya svāhā | vaktradīpanaṃ || 

oṃ haṁ hiṁ sadyojātavāmadevābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ hiṁ huṁ 
vāmadevāghorābhyāṃ svāhā ||

oṃ huṁ hyaṁ aghora tatpuruṣābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ heṁ hāṁ 
tatpuruṣaiśānābhyāṃ svāhā | vaktrasaṃdhānaṃ | oṃ hauṁ hyaiṁ huṁ hiṁ haṁ 
īśānatatpuruṣāghoravāmadevasadyojātebhyaḥ svāhā | agnikoṇādvāyukoṇa nai##(-)

<30a>

nityanaittakakānyeyostvanyathaiva ||

uktañca || vaktrābhighorasandhāne kuryāt sadyādi sambaraiḥ | 
yadvaśānādibhiḥ paścāt karmajñātvānakaikatāṃ ||

dhyātvā vaktrāṇi pañcāgneryeṇa yatkarma vāñchitāṃ tanmukhye mūrddhe 
kurvīta tatsthāne corddhagaṃ mukhaṃ | antarbhādhyānya vaktrāni tacca 
kuṇḍapramānakaṃ |

śivorudrāgrahādityā brahmomendrācyutā dayaḥ |
hutāsanamukhā sopi sarvadeva mayoharaḥ ||

itthaṃ jātakarmadaśame || īśena saṃpūjyastreṇa hutvā ||

oṃ hāṁ śivāgnistvaṃ hutvāsana ityabhidhāya vāgīsau sampūjya pratyekaṃ 
svāhāntenāhuti daśakaṃ datvā visṛjyatthaya samāghrikasakuśauśruksruvau 
vādāya ghṛtapūrṇaśrugagre puṣpaṃ datvā tadīkṣakaḥ puskaro paryadho mukhaṃ 
śruvaṃ nidhāyāgra paścāt krameṇa saṃkhyākāra

<30b>

savyavāmahastābhyāṃ tiryagnābhau dhṛtvā śanairvāmastanāntaṃ hadantaṃ 
mukhāntaṃ vā śrukmūlaṃ nītvā vauṣaḍantamūlena sarvakāmapūriṇīṃ 
parvābharāṃ pūrṇādadyāditi nāmakaraṇaṃ | itthaṃ 
garbhapuṃstvaśīmantajanmanāmāni || yaduktaṃ ||

śivāgnistu bhavedevaṃ pañcasaṃskārasaṃskṛtaḥ |
dīkṣānaityakai caiva kāmye vāpi vidhau varaḥ ||

pratyahaṃ vihitaṃ karma kuṇḍanyāllekhanādikaṃ |
jāgrāpayedatonāgniṃ nityaṃ naitye tu karmaṇi ||

saṃskṛte tvanvahaṃ kuṇḍe nāsek prāksaṃskṛtā nalaṃ |
tato dhūpādyarthaṃ svalpāgnimudhṛtyasthānāntare rakṣayet ||

yathauktaṃ ||

pācyāścarupuroḍāsā pañcasaṃskārasaṃskṛta |
anāhūta śive vahnau homastvā vāhite bhavet ||

oṃ hūṁ agnaye namaḥ ||

sampūjyapyāyanāya ṣoḍaśi dhyātvā(?) hutvā |
tvamagne caiśvaraṃ tejaḥ pāvanaṃ paramaṃ yataḥ ||

tasmāt tvadīya hṛpadme saṃsthāpya tarpayāmitaṃ |

<31a>

ityadhyeṣyasvadhyanāśāpuṭe niḥsṛtanāḍīṃ vahniṃ vāmanāsāpuṭapraviṣṭāṃ 
dhyātvāgnau śivaṃ sāṅgamāśrayo pādhitogni varṇaṃ sampūjya naivedya 
pavitra japādi vidhāya | bhagavanyathā sambhavibhi 
dravyaistapīṣāmitvāmityadhyeṣyāgnerjihvā 
saṅkalpyaśruvādibhirghṛtādīnimṛgīmudrayānyayāvāyavatilabrīhi 
prabhṛtīni muṣṭibhilājādīni tathā parānyapi vastūni vārāhī saṃkhinī 
dravyānurūpamudrābhiḥrjuhuyāt | yathoktaṃ || 

ghṛtābhāvaitilairhomaḥ kartavyaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥ | tathā | 

sarvakāmapradohomastilai yukto ghṛtaplutaiḥ | 
apradīptena hotavyaṃ madhu me cārpya nibandhane || 

pradīpte lelihāne ca hotā vahnau prasiddhyati | 
snigdha pradakṣiṇā vartaḥ śrutipracchādita dhvaniḥ || 

nityamūrddhagamorcismāt sa piṇḍitaśikhaḥ śubhaḥ |

<31b>

tato mūlaṃ svāhāntaṃ japaṃ saṃkhāṃ daśāṃsanāṃgānyapi hutvā 
pūrṇandatvā prāgyasmamrāntaramabhyarcyā tarpyavisṛjya svāhānta mūlena 
devāya bhakta grāsatrayamagnebhya ekaikandatvā camanādi nivedya stutvā 
prādekṣiṇyaṃ bhaktyā bhasmāvandyā | 

oṃ hāṁ bhū svāhā || oṃ hāṁ bhuvaḥ svāhā | oṃ sva svāhā || oṃ hāṁ 
bhūrbhuvaḥ svaḥ svāhā || vyāhati hutvāṣṭa puṣpya śivamabhyarcya visarjya 
kuṇḍavāhyasthā devānapi | caṇḍaṃ caṇḍādyā hutyā pūrṇāntaṃ 
santarpyāstreṇāṣṭau prāyaścittāhutī hutvā | oṃ hāṁ agnaye svāhā | oṃ hāṁ 
somāya svāhā | oṃ hāṁ agnī somābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ hāṁ agnaye sviṣṭaṃ 
kṛte svāhā | sviṣṭa kṛdāhutīṃ datvā | oṃ hāṁ hūṁ agnaye namaḥ | agni 
visṛjet || 

kuṇḍāgni koṇe maṇḍala dvayaṃ kṛtvā paścimamaṇḍalopānte | oṃ hāṁ 
bhadrebhyo namaḥ | pūrve | 

oṃ hāṁ mātṛbhyo namaḥ | yāmye ||

<32a>

oṃ hāṁ gaṇebhyo namaḥ | paścime ||

oṃ hāṁ yakṣebhyo namaḥ | saumye ||

oṃ hāṁ grahebhyo namaḥ | īśe | 
oṃ hāṁ aśurebhyo nama | agnau oṃ hāṁ rākṣaśebhyo namaḥ || nai(-)ṛtya ||

oṃ hāṁ nāgebhyo namaḥ | vāyau ||

tato maṇḍalābhyantare | oṃ hāṁ nakṣatrebhyo namaḥ | īśe ||

oṃ hāṁ rāśibhyo namaḥ | agnau ||

oṃ hāṁ visvebhyo namaḥ | nair(-)ṛtya ||

oṃ hāṁ kṣetrapālāyā namaḥ | vāyau ||

antarvaliḥ ||

athapūrve | oṃ hāṁ indrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ agnaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ yamāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ nair(-)ṛtyāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ varuṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ 
vāyave namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ kuverāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ īśānāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ 
brahmaṇe namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ viṣṇave namaḥ | prāgvat |

oṃ hāṁ nīlalohitāya namaḥ | madhye ||

abhyarcya svāhānta svasvamantreṇa jalaplutāntena vali dadyāditi ||

vahirvaliḥ |

oṃ ye raudrā raudrakarmāṇo rudrasthāni vāśināṃ saumyāścaiva tu ye keścit | 

<32b>

saumyasthāne nivāsinaḥ | mātarorudrarūpāśca gaṇānāmadhipāścaye | 
vighnabhūtāstathācānye digvidikṣu samāsṛtāḥ | sarveṣu prītamanasaḥ 
pratigṛhnastvimaṃ valiṃ | siddhiṃ jusanta me nityastrayebhyaḥ pātumāṃ sadā || 

oṃ pūrvādi daśadigvāsibhyo digīsabhūtamātṛgaṇarudrakṣetrapālādibhyaḥ 
svāhā ||

oṃ hāṁ vāyasādibhyaḥ samayabhedisya svāhā ||

maṇḍalādvahi pratyeka valiṃ dakṣaṃ(?) (*)(?) madhyamityuktvā 
hṛdāsarvā naiva visṛjya śivāntikaṃ gatvākarmārpaṇādi prāgvadvidadhyāt | 
phalaṃ mūlajalādyairvā homapūrṇavalaṃ bhavet ||

yadvālyaṃ līlāvatī mataṃ | tatrāpi kuṇḍasthaṇḍilādiṣvagniṃ prakṣālya 
nirīkṣaprokṣatāḍye | kravyādāṃśāntyaṃ ktvā(?)tyukṣādāyāgni 
trayamekīkṛtya vahni caitanyaṃ vinyasya ||

sadyādīnabhyarcya mūlānāhuti pañcakandatvā nāmakṛtvā kuṇḍamekhalāḥ 

<33a>

saṃprokṣatāsukuśacatuṣṭayaṃ varmaṇā ropyapūrvādi dikṣu 
brahmaviṣṇurudrānantā nabhyarcyāgnisaṃpūjya santarpya | 
śivatarpanārthammadhyeṣya śivamāvāhyasantarpyapūrṇandatvā nivedyādi 
nivedya bhaśmavanditvā vyāhṛti hutvā śivamabhyarcya visarjya 
sviṣṭakṛdāhuti valiyaṃ datvā karmārpayet ||

caturdaśyānupāpunyāṃ pañcadaśyāntu pakṣayoḥ |
ayane viṣuverāho vyatīpātāṣṭakādiṣu ||

japahomādikaṃ karma dviguṇaṃ tu samācaret ||

itthaṃ samāpyavidhivat prātakṛtyamatandritaḥ |
sadguro śṛṇuyodbhaktyā cintayedathacācayet ||

pūrṇimā pratipadvarṣa caturdaśyāṣṭamīstyajan |
saptamī navamī triraṣṭaketi |

saṃdhyāstasitarnighātedigdāhādīnapīritān |
maṇḍale gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ samabhyarcya śivaṃ gurūn ||

śārayantra sthitaṃ śāstrantathā jñānagurūṃ prabhuṃ |

<32b>

praṇipātādināpaścāpaṭhedyāvadgurormataṃ |
tatsamāptau suviśrāmya praṇamyā paramet punaḥ ||

madhyāhne prāgvadvāhya svāmaitraḥ paścāṅgṛhe vrajet |
vaṣāsuniyamastvaṣalo(?)yaccārundhatī śavita | nadyāṃ nade taḍāge vā palvale 
plavanādiṣu |

uttamaṃ syādgṛhe śreṣṭhaṃ puskarinyāñca madhyamaṃ |
dīrghyādau kanyasaṃ kūpena kintū dhṛtyadūrataḥ ||

śrotamyapi malasnāne prāṅmukhaḥ sarvadā bhavet |
uttarāsyā vidhi snāne brahmacārī gṛhī tathā ||

na jale śuṣkavastreṇa nakṣāpyādrāṃśukasthale |
jātvantaṃ tadadho vāpyu śuṣkavāsāśraye kriyaṃ ||

āgneya bhaśmanā snānaṃ patīnāṃ bhogamokṣadaṃ |
viśuddhagomayotthane dagdhena śiva vahninā ||

kṛtanyāsastadādāya dakṣahastena muṣṭinā |
nivṛtyādyanubhiḥ prāgvadviśodhyā mantrayet punaḥ |

ṣaḍaṅgena tato vāma karastha dakṣapāṇinā |
ādāyāstreṇamastādi pādāntaṃ cānyathā caret ||

<34a>

malasnānaṃ vidhisnānaṃ sābhiṣekantataḥ punaḥ |
kramāt mūrddhādyamīśādyairahastānaṃ hriguṇḍayet ||

muktaye'jādyaipāṇibhyāṃ tyajaṅgurvādisaṃnidhiṃ |
tālatrayamathāstreṇa vidhāya parivartayet ||

snānaṃ vastropavītaśca śitaṃ kāśāyameva ca |
aśuddhaṃ procchaye (*)(?) mavyutamuddhṛlanotbhuvi ||

māhaindraṃ jayate snānaṃ malavidhyātmakantathā |
sūyyāṃśuvarṣa sākā(?) padasaptagamāgamāt ||

mārutaṅgo kharo (*) tareṇutthaṃ puruṣena tu |
gajasaṃmīlitākṣeṇa kāryantadanumantrajāṃ ||

sadyodyāmantritāṃ'tobhirmānasaṃ manasaiva tu |
gaṃgārka tanayā sindhu sarasvatyādi satyayaḥ ||

spṛṣṭāṃ satkṣatrajāṃ vāpi mṛdaṃ saṃhitathā labhet |
tayā mūrddhnādi gātre cāmastrai kuryāntri puṇḍakaṃ ||

pārthivaṃ snānametaddhi sarvaduskṛta nāśanaṃ |
śucirmūrddhnā guroḥ pādau vibhṛyāta śivamuccaran ||

<34b>

gauravaṃ tanmano vṛtyā mantramāvilayāt smaran ||

ebhyo yathecchaṃ snānādi kṛtvāpyalpāṅga hīnakāṃ |
tato mṛttikayā yuktairjale saṃyamya dhāvitaṃ ||

snāne vastrādikaṃ daṇḍe vrajedāvaśadhaṃ yataḥ |
vire vyāstreṇa panthānaṃ madhastatvāni kalpayan ||

astrapañjara madhyasthaḥ gopāṇasūdṛśāni tu |
tasmin nācamya vidyānte dhāmasādāśivaṃ vrajet ||

tatra prāgavadyajelliṅge śivaṃ vāsthaṃḍilādiṣu |
sthaṇḍilepi yajen mantrā nāśuprāpnotityabhīpsitaṃ ||

kiṃ tvāvāhādikaṃ karma pratprahantabūduṣkaraṃ |
bhartānyabharaṇavyāja rājacaurāpavāyataḥ ||

cāṃcalyāṃ svetasaścati tasmālliṅgamatovaraṃ |
ācāryaskṛtasānnidhye liṅge pūjā yathā tathā ||

kṛtāphaladadātyeva pūrṇaṃ tena taduttamaṃ |
pūrvārcita śive śaktyā pradadyādvāṣṭapuṣpikān ||

śivāsanaṃ tathāmūrti śirastasyāṅga pañcakaṃ |

<35a>

ityaṣṭau pṛthagaṣṭābhi mantrairpuṣpānikalpayet |
pūryaktaṃ ca vidhiṃ kuryāt tīrthā paryayedgurau ||

yadā pūjitapūjā tu tatkālaṃ tvarayā bhavet |
tadā prāgbhūta śuddhyaiva dvārapālāditaḥ śive ||

iti mādhyāhnika vidhiṅkṛtvā bhuñjīta nānyathā prāyaścitta 
śrutervidvānmumuṣṭarapi tadyathā |

tadanirvatyayo snātimanaṃ suraṃ pūjitaṃ |
mantrāskaṃnādhi tiṣṭhanti yogapīṭhavyavasthitāḥ ||

muhūrtairpañcabhiryātaiḥ kṛtvāmādhyā kiṃ vidhiṃ |
bhuṃjānasma śivāmantrā bhavantya śivahāriṇaḥ ||

yākelipta gṛhaṃ nīte cūllīhomādike kṛte |
prāṇadhāraṇamātrādhīpatī sakṛṅgṛhī praṇaḥ ||

sāyaṃ prātaśca bhuñjīt tadvidhānaṃ manotkrave(?) |
tatra dhautāṃghri karaḥ kṛtā cāmanyāsau vauṣaḍantaṃ mṛtyuñjayena 
saptadhā jalamabhimantrya | varmaṇā bhasmanā vāriṇāyā svātmadakṣiṇa vāma 
pṛṣṭha

<35b>

sammukhaṃ krameṇa pūrvāgrarekhā dvayamuttarāgrarekhā dvayañca kuryāt | 
tadanu śuddhabhojana pātre vīkṣaṇādi saṃskṛte ghorasaptadhā 
vartyataduparicandrakoṭi sadṛśaṃ mṛtyuñjayañca | bhaktā ghoropya 
mṛtyuñjayeṇābhyukṣānnoparidakṣahastaṃ datvā prāgvatmṛtyuñjayañjayā 
prarocya pātrāntare bhaktādi saṃsthāpyagaḍūṣādhogalajjalena ||

oṃ nāgakurmakṛkara devadatta dhanañjayebhyaḥ upaprāṇavāyubhyaḥ svāhā ||

nivedyāstra mantreṇodarāgniṃ jvalaṃ dhyātvā |
oṃ amṛtopastaraṇamasi svāhā ||

āposānamādāya | oṃ prāṇāya svāhā ||

aṅguṣṭhatarjanī madhyamāṅguli trayena | oṃ apānāya svāhā ||

aṅguṣṭhamadhyānāmābhiḥ | oṃ samānāya svāhā | aṅguṣṭhānāmākālābhiḥ | 
oṃ udānāya svāhā | tarjavarjamaṅgulībhiḥ | oṃ vyāṇāya svāhā hā | 
sarvāṅgulībhiḥ | svalpāntena pañcagrāsīṃ kṛtvā || 

<36a>

ācāryaḥ pūrvābhimukhaḥ svarṇapātre | sādako dakṣiṇāsyo ropya | putrako 
aparāsyaustāsamayī | samayī saumyaṃ dṛglāhe vāmahastena pātraṃ pṛtvā 
mukhaśabdavarjaṃ svalpagrāsai bhuñjīta | lokranītyā vā pūrva yāmya 
paścimottara mukha krameṇa pūryasādhanaṃ tīrthā | keśādi prāptau ca tanmātra 
mannaddhṛtya hastaṃ prakṣālya bhasma saṃspṛśya | kāsyādyayajñīyapātre ca 
na | abhāvā bhasmanā saptadhā śuddhe saptadhā ghorajapte aghrau hastaṃ kṣīre 
kareṇa ca lavaṇaṃ ghṛtaṃ svādi dṛṣṭi paryusitañca dravyādi varjanaṃ | 
bhakṣopariṣa śabdaṃ vāmasthaṃ mukhanadhota haste nādau ca jalaṃ na pibet | tato 
bhojanāvasāne | oṃ amṛtāpidhāne masi svāhā | gaṇḍūṣamādāyā camya | 
oṃkālāgni rudrāya svāhā | dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhāgra sravajjalena 
dakṣapādāṅguṣṭhaṃ saṃsiṃcya parighamudrāṃ vadhnīyāt |

<36b>

āropya vāmahastasya kaniṣṭhāṃ nābhimaṇḍale | 
tāmeva dakṣahastasya vāmāṅguṣṭhena yojayet || 

vitatau ca karau kṛtvā dakṣāṅguṣṭhaṃ nyasenmukha | 
parighayaṃ samākhyātā duṣṭāhārapi nāsinī || 

tataḥ kṛta nyāsaḥ suprītaṃ śivaṃ dhyātvāddhūlya harītakṣmādi mukhaśuddhi | 
śivaṃ guruñca namaskuryāditi | sāntānikabhikṣābhojanaṃ ||

adhrago brahmacārī ca vidyārthī guru poṣakaḥ ||

devavratītapaśvī ca saḍetabhikṣukā smṛtāḥ | 
tasmād bhakṣaṃ naṅkartavyaṃ gṛhasthe na mahānmano ||

gṛhastho gṛhanīyo sādbhavetmā ca dvivāhitāḥ | 
vṛṣalyāparadāreṣu vesyādi gamanāntathā || 

patitāste tu vijñeyā na te yoḥ yo gṛhāśrame |
yastumādhūkarīṃ bhikṣāṃ kartamicchati pāvanīṃ ||

saśuddhabhasmanā snāta kaupīnaṃ parivartya ca |
jaṭāḥ saṃpamya cācamya kṛtanyāsaḥ śivaṃ guruṃ ||

<37a>

natvā tadājñayā pātraṃ saṃskuryāt maunato namana |
tāmramayo mayaṃ vā palāśa patra puṭaṃ navaṃ ||

bhikṣāpātraṃ sakāmānyastu vādyaṣṭhīvanādi kṛtā viśuddhasiktikādhāraṃ 
kapāmāṃvaravṛtaṃ | jvaladagni nibhaṃ tasmiṃ nyasyā ghoraṃ tadamvare 
varmāstumātma tulya tu daṇḍe sthatre ca pāṇḍare | vṛte sarāvasamyāte 
vyaṅgāre bhuktavajjane | 

adho dṛṣṭirdvijādīnāṃ gṛhaṃ gatvāgate sthitaḥ | 
bhikṣāṃ dehī tyathoktā gauryāvaddhansana pujyate ||

tāvat kālaṃ pratikṣata nanyūnaṃ nāpi vā'vikaṃ |
pratyāvṛtya gṛhādbhūyo bhikṣādānāya yajvanā ||

āhutopi ca tatsthānānnanivartatakarhacit |
tatraiva bhikṣyāṅgṛhnīyā pratyagrāma vidūṣitāṃ ||

na kāṃśyādi sthitāṃ nindyāṃ vṛṣalyākarairna ca |
na bhikṣāṃ ca rato bhikṣāmādadyānna vigarhitāṃ ||

śaivātsvaya bhuvādyaiśca kutaścilliṅginopi vā |

<37b>

maṣṭānna pracurāṃ bhikṣāṃ nādadyāmnāti saṃskṛtāṃ |
parihāsādi caturā yatra nāryastato'pi ca ||

mayūrāṇḍaṃ bhavedbhikṣāṃ puskalantaccaturguṇaṃ |
puṣkalāni tu catvāri hantakāro vidhīyate ||

evaṃ bhikṣāṭanaṃ kṛtvā paryāptiryāvadeva tu |
svāśramaṃ pratigaccheta svasti saṅkalpa yajjane ||

tāṃ nyasyāddhūlyābhyukṣāstradi dīptāṃ prāgvattrirbhajana | 
nivedya gurave bhāgaṃ śivāya ca pṛthak pṛthak ||

aṣṭagrāsādikaṃ śeṣaṃ bhuñjīteśaṃ mudrā smaran |
samparka mahaviṣyañca kṛtvā bhuttvā caredyataḥ ||

prāyaścitta mataye tu vidadhyādbhojane sadā | 
sāyāhnañca pratīkṣeta tatkathādyairna durjanaiḥ || 

tatkālepyuccamāruhya kuryādāvaśyakādikaṃ |
saucamācamanaṃ snānamathavā kaṭiśodhanaṃ ||

śuddhārdavāśaśā vāpi sarvagātra pramārjanaṃ |
aśiraskamatha snānaṃ sītenoṣṇane vāvunā ||

uddhṛlyasaṃdhyākaupyanbhyāsa phalaṃ karmakṛdbhajan ||

<38a>

kālādyupādhitaḥ śaivī śaktimekāmanekadhā |
pracchanna hṛdayo granthi paṭādyai śivamarcayet ||

snānapānīya dugdhādyairyadi sikto bhattadā |
snāyāt prakṣālayedvāpi nābherūrddhamadhastathā ||

tataḥ saṃskṛtya caraṇau ghṛtādyai śodhayet punaḥ |
yavagodhūmajaiścūrṇai mṛdubhirvārināmvitaiḥ ||

mantrātmātha śivaṃ dhyāye na hṛdimairtrya divāśanaḥ |
dṛṣṭo vāmatale dakṣa hastapṛṣṭhavaraṃ nyatiḥ ||

katthākaṭiṃ trikānye sṛtbhyamā pṛthamuraḥ puraḥ |
viṣṭabhya bhāvanā yuktaḥ śayītayoganidrayā ||

muktyairyāmya śiro guhyai pūrvanyatra turogadaṃ |
namo nandīśvarāyetiṣete yonyū dhruvādikaṃ ||

tasya kuṣmāṇḍarājebhyo na bhayambhavati kvacit |
maunenāśukha panyāmya(?) sūrddhā'ghāghaṃ dahehutaṃ ||

śayyā kamaṇḍalu bhasmā yatyastrī vastramāsanaṃ |
ādhāramupavītādi nānyajyeṣṭā śuddhi spṛśet ||

<38b>

suśaryāyāṃ gṛhasthopi svapeddāsagṛhe sukhaṃ |
oṣadhe vaidyanādhvantu nīlakaṇṭhañca bhojane ||

yātrāyāñca trinayanaṃ śayane girisaṃhṛdā |
umāpati maithune tu antakāle śivaṃ smaret ||

athārddharātre pūrvoktrāṃ sādhako yajaneddhiyāṃ |
divāsaṃbhūtatoyādyaiḥ kuryānnyarākṣaso citaiḥ ||

bhānuspṛṣṭaṃ kulaṃ pūta rātrau raktāyate suciḥ |
utthāya ca punaḥ śeṣa niśāyātma puroditaṃ ||

vidhiṃ kuryāt pratyahaṃ tvaśāṭhyaṃ vidhirniśedhayaḥ |
dehayātavyaṃ vahitaṃ pratīkṣana padamavyayaṃ ||

nityānandamaya śuddhaṃ śivāśakta śivājñayā |
gosnī vaṃśāvujārkaḥ praguṇaguṇanidhirlakṣitoṅke guruṇāṃ ||

vandāvrātādimāṃdyadviradavaraśiro bhedakṣaika siṃhaḥ |
siddhaṃ siddhānta sitvarvara gururakarodyaṃ kṛpāvān śakre hemābho 
vahnikāryaṃ vimalaśiva idaṃ kāśikā vāśasīlaḥ ||

<39a>

[vimalāvatyāṃ homavidhirdvitīyaḥ] ||

granthya <216> ||

gārvāṇi khānikhamanodi gaṇūtsakālāt kāryān śivātmasusaṃtītvadataśca 
nityāḥ | 

śiṣyaḥ śivaṃ sakalahāyanahānihāri prāha praṇamya phaṇiyāntrajajaṃ pavitraṃ ||

āśāḍhādau śreṣṭamadhyādhemaṃ kāryaṃ dvipakṣataḥ supte cyute 
deśikādyaiḥ pratyabdaṃ sādhyasiddhaye ||

āgnyāṃdi sarvadevāntaṃ guruṇā pratipatkramāt |
sūtrantadarthaṃ vidhavā brāhmaṇī kanyakādibhiḥ ||

akeśacchinnariktaṃ tu kartitaṃ susamaṃ namaṃ |
śubhannavaguṇaṃ dhauta sadyojātena vāribhiḥ ||

madanasya phalolanmiśrai pañcagavya sugandhikaiḥ |
nātisthūlādi sūkṣmannādagdhaṃ nāmalinādikaṃ ||

saṃśuddhaiḥ kalpitai śaivairvāmena granthitaṃ punaḥ |
aghorodhṛtakeśādi nicayaṃ rañjitantathā ||

raktacandanakāśmīra kastūrī candrarocanā |
dhātuścūrṇa haridrai tanmadhyādanyatamena tu ||

<39b>

granthau tatpuruṣe naiva tathaisānena dhūpitaṃ |
tastranyastadhruvetyādi prakṛtyādyāśca granthiṣu ||

kalaukārpāsijamukhyaṃ maunaṃ manyādi cānyataḥ |
padmavalkala padmātthaṃ muñjakṣemāsanādijaṃ ||

īśvarāṇādaridrāṇāṃ yathāyogasupūrakaṃ |
tatra gandhapavitrantu svalpataṃ tveka granthikaṃ ||

vacācampaka saileya haridrā dvayamustakaṃ |
saṭhīkuṣṭasurāmāṃsānyevaṃ sarvoṣadhī yutaṃ ||

ekaikaṃmeva sarveṣāṃ mānonmānavivarjitaṃ |
pradhānānāṃ pavitraṃ yantristri syādvalayā kṛtiḥ ||

talliṃgamastatulyaṃ vā'rkoṣṭādvāṅgulagarbhi vā |
hastādi navahastāntaṃ liṅgānāṃrāntaraiḥ saha ||

aṣṭāviṃśatito vṛddhaṃ daśabhirdaśabhi kramāt |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ yāvalliṅgamastakaṃ garbhakaṃ ||

vyaktānāṃ nābhijānvaghri prāntaṃ hīnādito navā |
aṣṭottaraśatenāsryaṃ madhyamaṃ syāt tadarddhataḥ ||

kanyasaṃ saptaviṃśasyā kvacit ṣaṭtriṃśatārddhataḥ |

<40a>

pañcāśatāṣatriṃśena tricatvāriṃśatāthavā |
ekāśītyāṣṭaviṃśatyā tulyagranthātarālakaṃ ||

granthibhirdaśabhiryuktamathavā sūtrasaṃkhyakaiḥ |
gaṅgāvatāsaṃjñe tu vaddhāgranthi catuṣṭayaṃ ||

vitasbhyantaramānena punaḥ kāryā catuṣṭayaṃ |
evaṃ samāpyate tāvadyāvadgranthi dvaya punaḥ ||

śaktirūpamidaṃ śeṣṭaṃ piṇḍikāntāvalambi ca |
tatra pradhānaṃ sūryasya pavitrāṇāṃ catuṣṭayaṃ ||

kahyaṇi kāṣṭadaṅgānāṃ yathāśobhamihāṣṭakāḥ |
ekadvitricatupañcaraśāścāṣṭadaśagrahaiḥ ||

rudrārkadvyaṣṭasūtrairdhātāśca pañcādi parvikāḥ |
ekaikābrahmaṇo lakṣmāstadeśendrādi digbhūtāṃ ||

sūryavacchiva kumbhāsyārekaṃ svasya gaṇasya ca |
guruṇāṃ vā tathā sambho catuṣṭayamathāṣṭakaṃ ||

tatpatyā ekamathavādaṅgānāṃ na nava smṛtāḥ |
śivāgni vidyā caṇḍānāṃ śivavat dvāriṇā na ca ||

dvādaśāntarvalestadvadakādaśavahirvali |
guro ekahṛdālambi bhadraṃvidyādharī mate ||

uktametadvanāṣṭāni(?) (*)(?)syaikakamīśavat |
sūryakumbhāgni caṇḍīśa vidyādīnāntathā phalaṃ ||

daśaiva gandha yutaṃ syācchataṃ nava ca kaṅkanī |
svasyaikaṃ tu guroścātha mukhyaṃ taṃ taśca viṃśatiḥ ||

saptagaṅgāvatārāśca prāgvatkaṅkaṇikādayaḥ |
evamekatayāsaṃkhyarāmartapakṣalakṣitāḥ ||

śucyādiṣvevamriṣvindro sthānātyātā'yaratna vā |
luptaṃ daivātpavitraṃdākārtikyāmāśvinethavā ||

doṣamātra hṛtau yadvā ghoraṃ japtvā vidhau dadet |
triśu pinavābhāvātsarvānmaikamapi prabhāḥ ||

atha kṛtvā trayodaśyāṃ saptaṃmyāṃvāśca nityaṃkaṃ |
kṛtanaimittika snānaṃ saṃdhyādīkṣādikeṣvapi ||

nādhimāse ca vastrāyuktadhāmtyarcayedraviṃ |
dvārayānapinātmānaṃ yasya prākṛtamācaran ||

svaśuddhyarthāntimaṃ vāme naśadakṣakarorcayet |

<41a>

mūle nāropyataṃ pūrdhni kṣesinaṃ hastakaṃ |
śivohamādi sarvajñaṃ ityābhāvyāṇḍaśuddhi kṛt ||

vitasti mānaṃ ṣaṭtriśabda sapatrātthasāgrakaṃ |
jñānakhaḍgaṃ tu saptāstra japtaṃ venyākṛtiṅkare ||

kṛtvārghapātramādāya gatvārakṣodiśaṃ guruṃḥ |
yāgamaṇḍapamīśāsya saṃskuryāt kutravat tataḥ ||

lājācandanasiddhārtha bhaśmapuṣpakuśākṣatān |
saptāstrajaptadīptāstra rūpānastreṇa vistaret ||

cikitkṣuśakurcatāssaṃhṛtyai śadaśaṃ nayet |
astravarddhanikādhāre tato nir(-)ṛtirdik cchataṃ ||

brahmāṇamahālakṣmī pūrayantī māvālayaṃ |
mahāratnairyajedvāri smaren maṇḍaparūpiṇīṃ ||

calaṃ saḍutthaṃkaṃ datvā paścimāsyā vṛṣasthitaṃ |
mṛrtyākumbhaṃ nyasedvācyaṃ saptabrīhyuparisthitaṃ ||

hemādyaikatamaṃ liptaṃ jñānaśaktiṃ kratu prabhuṃ |
sadā nadyāmya digbhāge spṛṣṭāntaddakṣapāṇinā ||

pratyagnālaṃ tu siṃhasthāṃ varddhanī vighnamardinīṃ |
nyasya satrutthake mūrtyā bhūyaḥ kumbhe purāṇaṇāṃ śastumabhyarcyayet tasya 
kriyāśaktiṃ tathālukāṃ ||

<41b>

oṃ haḥ astrasanāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ haḥ astramūrtaye hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | 
varddhanīmāropya ||

oṃ haḥ astrāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | prāgvado cāhya | oṃ haḥ astra hṛdayā hūṁ 
phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ haḥ astra śirase hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ haḥ astra śikhāyai hūṁ 
phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ haḥ astra kavacāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ haḥ hūṃ phaṭ astrāya 
hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ || 

sakalādi vidhāya bhūṣita ghaṭeṣu sthaṇḍileṣu vā praṇave hṛdāsanān |
digvalāt pūjayet | oṃ hāṁ indrāya sahaśrākṣāya pītavarṇāya airāvatā rūḍhāya 
vajrapāṇaye pūrvadikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ agnaye piṅgavarṇāya 
śaktipāṇaya'gni dikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ yamāya nīlavarṇāya mahiṣārūḍhāya 
daṇḍapānaye dakṣiṇadikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ nir(-)ṛtaye kṛṣṇavarṇāya 
sa vā ruḍhāya khaḍgapāṇaye nai(-)ṛta dikpataye namaḥ |

<42a>

oṃ hāṁ varuṇāya śuklavarṇāya makarārūḍhāya pāśapāṇaye paścima 
dikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ vāyavebhyāma varṇāya mṛgārūḍhāya 
dhvajapāṇaye vāyudikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ kuberāya gauravarṇāya 
triṃpyārūpe gadāpāṇaye uttaradikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ īśānāya trinetrāya 
svetavarṇāya vṛṣārūḍhāya śūlapāṇaye īśānadikpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ 
brahmaṇe saśrucatusmukhāya gauravarṇāya haṃsārūḍhāya padmapāṇaye 
ūrddhatigpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṁ viṣṇave śyāmavarṇāya vanamāline 
garuḍārūḍhāye cakrapāṇaye'dhādigpataye namaḥ ||

tato varddhanīṃ pṛṣṭhatakalasenānugamyamānāmādāyamūlaṃ paṭhan |
oṃ śivayāgaḥ pravṛttoyaṃ tadbhāktānā śivājñayā | rakṣaṇīyāt tadāyebhyo 
lokapālāḥ samāhitaiḥ | bho bho śakra tvayā svasyāṃ diśivighnapraśāntaye |

<42b>

sā vadhyanetra karmāntaṃ na vitavyaṃ śivājñayā ||

amukapūjākāle pratyekaṃ svanāmnā śrāvayen |
pūrvādīśāntamavicchinnajaladhārāṃ bhrāmayitvādau kumbha paścāt dyāmye 
varddhanī nidhāya prāgīśāsyāsthāptastasthi(?) (*)(?) śaktyādi 
śaktiparyantaṃ | pūrṇāsanaṃ śivaṃ sāṅgavarddhanyāmastramabhyarcya | 
hṛdāṅguṣṭhena kumbhaspṛṣṭvā tato muṣṭinā varddhanīṃ vubhukṣuḥ 
mumukṣamuṣṭivarddhanīmiti | bhagaliṅgayogaṃ vācyavaddhāsarvaṃ kuryāt | oṃ 
yajñasyāsya patistvaṃ hi mūrtireṣā tavācalā | eṣate jñānanistriṃśastadgṛhāṇa 
somāśraye yajñā na khaḍgamaṣṭottaraśatamūlametatsaṃkhāṃ daśāṃśaṃ vā 
| astravarddhanyāṃ ca samarpya |

oṃ mayāpravartitaścāyaṃ yajyaṃ nābhavatakratuḥ | rakṣaṇīyastvayaitārha 
samāptiryāvadasya hi ||

oṃ umāyai bhagarūpinyai liṅgarūpadharāya ca | śaṅkarāya namastubhyaṃ 
bhaktānugrahakāriṇe ||

<43a>

vijñāpyagaṇaguruśca pūrvavadabhyarcya pañcagavyādibhiḥ śivasaṃsnāpya 
saṃpūjyāgniṃ niṣpādvyacarūṃ sādhayet ||

tadvidhiścaikajadyuktaḥ procyate ca taduktibhiḥ |
astrāvukṣālitāṃ sthāliṃ nyasya visve tadantare ||

āsanādi kramāt sambhuṃ yajedāvaṇaṃvitā |
dhyātvā tadasmisuṃpūrṇāntataḥ puṣpavahikṣipet ||

abhyukṣontasaṃśuddhaṃ kṣīraṃsyāmādi taṇḍulaṃ |
sthālyantarnikṣipet mantrī culyāntāmadhiropayet ||

āgneyāṃ saṃskṛtāyāñca pūrvāsya śivamuccaran |
carukambipacatmantrī cālanā ghāṭanaṃ ca na ||

hṛtmantrakavacābhyāñca pākajñastu śaniḥ śanaiḥ |
mantrasaṃhitayākārpyaṃ svāhānte vaṣaḍantayā ||

śruvena ghṛtapūrṇena taptaśīte'bhighoraṇaṃ |
dhruvakliṣkāsanāmiṣṭvā tayāsapātamārabhet ||

svāhāntayā kṣipedvārāṃ svabhyagnau heti taccarau |
tataḥ saṃhitayā mantrī mantraye dvaṣaḍantayā ||

<43b>

tataḥ prarocayet saktyā mudrayā vauṣaḍantayā |
pāpasaṃtacca devāgni svātmarthaṃ trirbhajediti ||

vahnau śivaṃ samāvāhya prāgvatsantarpyasaṃhitaṃ |
sunimittādi kṛte hutvā pūrṇāndadyāt | 

tatorghāmbu prokṣitāni saṃhitā mantritāni pavitrāṇyagni sannidhau 
mṛgacarmādibhirācchādyavatsarātmakaṃ sarvakarmasākṣiṇaṃ śivasmaran |

triśaptasaṃhitayā saṃpātaśodhitāni kṛtvā |
tatsūtreṇa varmaṇā yāgamaṇḍapādi saṃveṣṭhya sṛyāntikaṅgatvā ||

oṃ samastetyādi paṭhitvā tasmai śāṅgāya svāhānta svamantreṇa gandhapavitraṃ 
naivedyādi ca dadyāt | tato dvārapālebhyo brahmaṇe mahālakṣmai lokapālebhyaśca 
prāgukta mantraiḥ nivedayet |

tataḥ ślokau paṭhetvā svamantreṇa kumbheśāya sāṅgāya pavitraṃ 
naivedyādikaṃ mayi datvā | astreṇāstra varddhanyai gaṇapataye gurubhyaśca 
naivedyādibhiḥ santarpya svāhānta mūlenānmaṇe dadyāt |

<44a>

śrīmayakṣīravṛkṣotthaṃ dvādaśāṅgulamāyataṃ |
nareṇavarmaṇā vāpi pūrvato dantadhāvanaṃ ||

dakṣiṇe bhasmadātavyaṃ rūpiṇā śikhayāthavā |
mṛttiko paścime deyā sadyojātena vā hṛdā ||

oṃ hare deva devasya dadyādāmalakī phalaṃ |
jalañca vāmadevena śirasā vāpi pāvanaṃ ||

aiśānyāmīśamantreṇa mūlamantreṇa vā jalaṃ |
sugaṃdhi pañcagavyañca palāśapuṭasaṃsthitaṃ ||

aiśānyāṃ kusumandadyādāgneyyāṃ diśirocanāṃ |
agaruṃ nair(-)ṛtāśāyāṃ vāyavyāṃ tu ca sassamaṃ ||

homadravyāni sarvāṇiṃ sadyojāte kuśaiḥ sahaḥ |
daṇḍākṣasūtrakaupīna bhikṣāpātrāṇi dakṣiṇe ||

kajalaṃ kuṅkumaṃ tailaṃ śalākākeśa śodhanaṃ |
tāmbulandarpaṇandadyāduttare rocanāmapi ||

āsanaṃ pāduke pātraṃ yogapaṭṭātapatrakaṃ |
īśānyāmīśamantreṇa dadyādīśāna tuṣṭaye ||

<44b>

pūrvasyāñcarukaṃ sājyaṃ sānugandhādikaṃ nare |
yada sampannameteṣāṃ manasā tatprakalpayet ||

tataścaturcarma pavitramādāya prāgvacchivaṃ sañcintya ||

oṃ samastavidhicchidrai pūraṇenamakhamprati |
prabhavāmantrayomitvāṃ tvadicchāvāpti kārakaḥ ||

tatsiddhi mantrajānīhi yajataścida cityate |
sarvathā sarvadāśambho namastestu praśīdyame ||

paṭhitvāmantrya recakāmṛtī kṛtaṃ layāntaṃ mūlamuccāryāropayet |
tatoṅgerbhyaṃ datvā śivāya naivedya japapraṇāmādi kṛtvā durgāyai 
śāṅgāyai dadyāt |

evamagnāvapiśivamabhyarcya hutvā pūrṇāṃ prāyaścittaṃ vyāhṛtiñca |
śivamabhyarcya mūrtisthīkṛtyamaṇḍalārcita śivanāḍī saṃdhānena yojayet ||

taduktaṃ ||

ūrṇātantu nibhāṃ nāḍī muditena vinirgatāṃ |
anuditena visantīṃ tāṃ nirgatā muditena ca ||

ātmanonudite naiva viṣantīñcintayedguruḥ |

<45a>

evaṃ sarvatrasandhānaṃ kāryaṃ gurvannamuhṛtā |
tataḥ sveṣṭakṛdāhutindatvā niṣṭhurayāgniṃ nirudhyāntarvahilīya citraṇārcayet ||

dvārapālādi śivāstra varddhanīṃ cāvisajya |
atha viśuddhavaṃsādi pātre vīkṣādi śuddhaprāgvaddharmāstra 
hṛdāyānivāropya taduparisamastāni pavitrāṇi nidhāya ṣaḍaṅgenālabhya 
punarapi hṛdastra carmāṇi cānyasyānyena viśuddhavastranāpidhāya varmaṇā 
sūtreṇāveṣṭyā hṛdādibhirabhyarcya bhagavannanukampayaitāni pavitrāṇi 
rakṣetānyabhidhāya śivakumbhāya samarpya śivavadvidyāpīṭhaṃ guruñca 
sampūjya vācyavat pañcagavyādi pāśyakṛtanyāsagītastuti 
natijapajāgarobhuktyai kuśaimuktyai bhasmampupavāsa svayedityadhivāsanaṃ ||

taccotthāya snānaṃ saṃdhyekṣa tvebhādi spṛhātyajan |
aṣṭapuṣpāsamabhyarcya hṛdodhṛtyapavitrakaṃ ||

<45b>

nidhāyeśānadigbhāge maṇḍale visṛjecchivaṃ |
nirmālyāpanayet saṃbhumiṣṭvākadvāri brahmaṇaḥ ||

śriyaṃ coktavācyarūpā dikpālakumbhakān |
varddhanī gaṇagurvādi maheśaśivapāvakān ||

samabhyarcya viśeṣeṇa mantrotsantarpya rākṣavat |
tataḥ sūryāntikaṃ gatvā dūrvāpuṣpākṣatānvitaṃ ||

vidhāyāñjali madhyasthaṃ sudhūpita pavitrakaṃ |
oṃkāletyādi svāhetyantaṃ sarvatraiva prati tatvaṃ paṭhitvā oṃ hrāṁ hrīṁ śaḥ 
ātmatatvā'dhipāya sūryāya svāhā | samāropyāṅgebhyopi naivedyādi vidadhyāt 
dvāradikpālebhyaśca | kumbhaśāya tatvacatuṣṭayena hṛdādyaṃgebhyopi datvā 
naivedya japānte varddhanyai vāṅgebhyaḥ | svātmena gaṇanāthāya pavitraṃ 
gurupaṃktaye | datvā naivedya jāpyādi prārthyājñāṃ kramasastataḥ | tataḥ kiñcit 
kalaśasanmukhā bhūtvā vayātmādi śivaṃ smṛtvā gandhādyanvitaṃ pavitraṃ 
gṛhītvā ||

<46a>

tālu bindu brahmaviladvādaśānte | 

oṃ kālātmanā tvayā deva yaddṛṣṭaṃmāmake vidhau |
kṛtaṃ kliṣṭaṃ samutsṛṣṭaṃ hṛte guptañca matkṛtaṃ ||

tadastu kliṣṭamakṛṣṭaṃ kṛtaṃ puṣṭaṃ masatkṛtaṃ |
sarvātmanāṃmunāṃśambho pavitreṇa tvadicchayā ||

oṃ pūraya <2> makhavrataniyameśvarāya svāhā |
oṃ hauṁ ātma tatvādhipāya śivāya svāhā ||

ityātmatatvaṃ prakṛtyaṃtaṃ brahmākāraṇaṃ māyāntamantroccāraṇa yuktaṃ 
dhyātvā prathamamāropayet | oṃ hauṁ vidyātatvādhipāya śivāya svāhā | 
vidyātatvaṃ vidyāntaṃ viṣṇukāraṇamīśvarāntaṃ mantroccāraṇānvitaṃ 
dhyātvā dvitīyāṃ ||

oṃ hauṁ śivatatvādhipāya śivāya svāhā ||
śivatatvaṃ śaktyantaṃ rudrakāraṇaṃ śadā śivāntaṃ mantroccāraṇa yuktaṃ 
sañcintya tṛtīyaṃ | oṃ hauṁ sarvatatvādhipāya śivāya pavitrakaṃ svāhā | 
sarvakāraṇaṃ sarvatatvaṃ vyāpilayāntamūloccāreṇa yogi dhyātvā caturthaṃ 
gaṅgāvatāraṃ | mumukṣustu | catukṣustu śivavidyātma sarvatatvai namontairvā 
dadyāt | tato'ṅgebhyo datvā bhagavate vidhidha naivedyaṃ japañca samarpya 
puṣpāñjaliṃ puṭaḥ śivaṃ saṃtuṣṭaṃ dhyātvā vijñāpayet ||

oṃ tvaṃ gatiḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ saṃsthistvaṃ carācare |
antaścāreṇa bhūtānāṃ unnotvaṃ parameśvare ||

karmanāmanasāvācātvatonānyāgatirmama |
mantrahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ bhaktihīnaṃ ca yatkṛtaṃ ||

japahomārcanāhīnaṃ kṛtaṃ nityaṃ mayā tava |
akṛtaṃ vākyahīnañca tatpūraya maheśvara || 

supūtastvaṃ śureśāna pavitraṃ pāpanāśane | 
tvayā pavitritaṃ sarvaṃ jagatsthāvarajaṅgamaṃ ||

khaṇḍitaṃ yanmayā deva vrata vaikalpa yogataḥ |
ekī bhava tu tatsarvaṃ tavājñāsūtra gusphitaṃ ||

atha stutyādi vidhāya catustridvyekamāsamāsārddha saptāha pañcāhaḍyahaikā 
heṣu madhyādekatamaṃ guruḥ |

<47a>

prasādīkṛtaṃ vāyavitraṃ vidhātuṃ niyamaṃ svīkṛtya durgāyai nivedayet |
tato vahnisthamapi śivavat pavitranābhyarcya pūrṇāntaṃ hutvā prāyaścittaṃ 
vidhāyāgnistha śivaṃ śive saṃyojyāgni nirupyāntarvahirvalī sapavitrau nivedya 
śivāntika gatvā karma samarpyaṇaṃ kuryāt | tato vidyāpīṭhaṃ 
śavavatsāṅgamabhyarcya naivedyādibhistarpayet | tadanta guruṃ 
śivavadvastraśuvarṇapavitrādibhiḥ | saṃtuṣṭikāribhirabhyarcya pati dvijādīnapi 
santarpya ||

dānenānena bhagavān prīyatāṃ me sadāśiva ||

iti manasāvadhārayediti pavitradānaṃ ||

tataḥ prātaḥ punaḥ prāgvadukta nitya kriyauttaraṃ sūryādyagnyantamabhyarcya 
tadādyaṃ cānti me svataḥ | 

pavitrāṇi samāropya kṛtacihnāni pūrvavat |
santarpyāgnau śivaṃ pūrṇāṃ prāyaścittaṃ pavitravit ||

<47b>

visṛjyasaṃśivāgniñca saṃrakṣacaṇḍapūjane |
vratī śivāntikaṃ gatvā kuryāt karmasamarpanaṃ ||

muktyarthī vātha bhogārthī vidhinānena tadyathā |
tvatprasādena karmedaṃ māmestu nāthabandhakaṃ ||

tvatprasādena karmedaṃ mamāstu phalasādhakaṃ |
tatoṣṭapuspyā(?)sampūjya hṛdodhṛte pavitrakaṃ ||

visṛjya vidhineśādyamaṇḍapaṃsaṃviśosya ca |
vāribhiśo mayonmiśrairathayāgādvahiryajet ||

īśe liptethavā vastrā vṛtaṃ pīṭhethavā kṛtau |
visverddhendu nice caṇḍaṇṭhukābhe vāmbujāśanai ||

oṃ caṇḍāsanāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | saḍutthāsanoparyabhyarcya | oṃ 
caṇḍamūrtaye hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | mūrtinīlāñjanacchāyāñcaturvaktrārka 
locanāṃ | sarpopavītakeyūrāṃ mukhocchāgraravārcipaṃ | jvalajjaṭārddha 
candrādyāmatibhīmāṃ caturbhujāṃ | 

śūlaṃ ḍamarukamvāme dakṣe ṭakākṣamālinī |
rudrāgni prabhavāṃ dhyātvā mūlenā vāhyayet paraṃ ||

oṃ oṃ dhvani caṇḍeśvarāya hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |
āvāhnahṛdāsthāpanādi vidhāya | 

<48a>

oṃ caṇḍahṛdayāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ caṇḍa śirase hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ 
caṇḍaśikhāyai hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ caṇḍakavacāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | oṃ 
caṇḍāstrāya hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ | sakalādau hṛdā prāgvatyādyādi datvā 
samyagabhyarcya | bhogāṅgānyapi | tato gandha pavitraṃ 
śivavatmūlenāropyāṅgebhyo japādikaṃ kuryāt | tataḥ pavitraṃ gṛhītvā | oṃ 
hāṁ ātmatatvādhipāya dhvani caṇḍeśvarāya hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | evaṃ 
vidyādyairapyāraupyāṅgebhyaśca naivedyānte | sarvāṇi pavitrāṇyādāya ||

oṃ lehya coṣyānnapānādi tāmbūlaṃ śragvilepanaṃ |
nirmālya bhojanaṃ tubhya pradattaṃ tu śivājñayā ||

sarvametat kriyā kāṇḍaṃ mayācaṇḍa tavājñayā | 
nyūnādhika kṛtaṃ mohātparipūrṇaṃ sadāstu me |

tato nityapi ||

yatkiñcidvārṣikaṃ karma kṛtaṃ nyūnādhikaṃ mayā |
tadastu paripūrṇamme caṇḍanātha tavājñayā ||

<48b>

paṭhitvā vijñāpya mūlena pavitra naivedyādīni samarpya praṇamya yathā vasaraṃ 
vahnāvabhyarcya saṃtarpya visṛjya vahiḥ nisṛtya caṇḍamūrtisthīkṛtya | oṃ 
pheṁ caṇḍeśa mūrtaye namaḥ |

visṛjyāndhakūpādau nirmālyaṃ prakṣipya bhūmi viśodhya śivañca saṃsnāpya 
sampūjya visarjayet | trayodaśī caturdaśībhyāṃ dinadvaye trayodaśyāṃ 
gandhapavitraṃ caturdaśyāṃ tu pavitrañcaṇḍārcane | tathā caturdaśī 
pūrṇimābhyāṃmapi | caturdaśyāṃ gandhapavitraṃ pavitra 
paurṇamāśyāṃsūpavītaṃcaṇḍapūje tithi pūjyatvaṣṭamyāṃmapyevaṃ | 

uktañca ||

yadāndheka dine śambhoḥ pavitrādyañcikīrṣati |
kṛta nityaṃstadā saṃkṛtvā naimittikīṃ sakṛt ||

saṃmyaggandhapavitrasya datvopari pavitrakaṃ |
uddhṛtya datvā caṇḍāpaliṅgasaṃsnāpya pūjayet ||

sthaṇḍileyorcayedīśaṃ tasya naiṣa bhaved vidhiḥ |

<49a>

prasnārtānarcitaṃ tariṅgaṃ caṇḍācorddhaṃ dharennayet |
pavitrādiṣu caṇḍaiśaṃ spṛṣṭaiva vidhinārcayet ||

pavitrādyarghayetadvadvisṛjyāpyā camettadā |
avirjita pūtastu naivasīmāṃ vilaṃghayet ||

devatāpyanyathāpnoti siddhiṃ bhraṃśaṃ pade pade |
vimalo vimalaṃ vimalādiśivośi'śivaśoṣamameṣamumesaḥ | 
vidadhe vidhe codvidhivodhavudhaḥ paramaṃ parameṣṭi pavitramidaṃ ||

[vimalāvatyāṃ pavitravidhistṛtīyaḥ] ||

grantha <136> ||

kṣoṇīkandajatāvakaṇūkakalātatvāntanāloṅgamaṃ |
māyāgranthi catupyugāghridamanayaḥ śuddhavidyāṃvujaṃ ||

vidyeśāṣṭadalaṃśritaḥ śiva umākiñjalkamīśāṃvikā |
yugmānecca sabījakarṇikamasau siṃhāsanantaṃnumaḥ ||

kṛtāplavādinokṛṣṇa saptamyāṃ vā trayodaśīṃ |

<49b>

tithaudhyāmāntikaṅgatvā'sādhyavīkṣādinārcayet |
saṃcityā mantrayettaṃ bhavavākyena tadyathā ||

oṃ haraprasādasambhūtatvaṃ matrasannidhī bhaya śivakāryaṃ samuddiśyane 
tadhyāsi śivājñāyā ||

evamāmantryasaṃrakṣa vrajedvaśmā dūrataḥ | 
sthitamānīya mṛtpūrṇapātrasthaṃ tu jalākakṣitaṃ || 

gṛhe dhyāntrayet prāgvat nānyaṃ devaṃ smaran sivāt | 

sāyāhna samaye prāpte vidadyādadhi vāsanaṃ | 
pavitroku vidhānena bhānvādyagnyanta pūjanaṃ |

kṛtvā palāśa puṭikāḥ |

succhādi saṃyutāḥ || 

damasodbhavamūlādi saṃyuktāḥ pañcasobhanāḥ | 
pratyekaṃ dhenumudrādyānmaśetsadyodibhiryathā ||

oṃ sadyojātaṃ prapadyāmi sadyojātāya vai namaḥ |
bhava bhavenādi bhave bhaje svarmābhavadbhavāya namaḥ ||

yadvā bhavodbhavo namaḥ | 

anena hṛdā vā mṛttikānvitaṃ damanamūlampaścime ||

<50a>

oṃ vāmadevāya namo jyeṣṭhāya namo rudrāya namaḥ |
kālāyā namaḥ kalavikaraṇāya namo vala pramathanāya namaḥ sarvabhūte 
damanāya manonmanāya namaḥ ||

anena śirasā vāsāmalakī phalaṃ tannālamuttare ||

oṃ aghorabhyotha ghorebhyo ghoraghoratarabhyaśca sarvataḥ sarvasarvebhyo namaste 
rudra rūpebhyo namaḥ ||

anena śikhayā vā tatpatraṃ bhasmavaddakṣiṇe ||

oṃ tatpuruṣāya vidmade mahādevāya dhīmahe | tannorudra pracodayānnamaḥ ||

anena kavacena vā tatpuṣpaṃ dantadhāvanañca pūrve || 

oṃ īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāmīśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ brahmanopi 
yatirbrahmaśivomastu sadāśivāya namaḥ | athavā sadāśiva namaḥ || 

anena mūlena vā gāyatryā vā tatphalaṃ gandhasahitamīśāne dadyāt | 
devākṣaravaktrairvā damane puṣpaphalayo ca bhāve tatpatramarvānu kalpayet ||

<50b>

tataḥ pañcāṅgākhaṇḍa damanamañjalau kṛtvā śivaṃ saṃcityā mantrayet | 

oṃ āmantritosi deveśa prātaḥ kāle mayā prabho |
kartavyanta yathālābhaṃ pūrṇaparvatavājñayā ||

paṭhitvā svāhānta mūlenā ropyāṅgādibhyaścāśeṣadamanampavitraṃ vatpātre 
saṃrakṣa śivāya samarpya prāgvadvivircā bhutsvā śivāgrainisānnayet ||

prātaḥ snātve'ṣṭaṣyaiśamiṣṭvā visṛjya pūrvavat | 
nityāṃ naimittikīṃ kuryādviśeṣeṇa kriyāṃ tataḥ ||

pañcāṃgā khaṇḍitai dhyāmaiḥ śivamiṣṭvānyamādadet |
hṛṣṭaśadāśivaṃ dhyātvā pañcāsyamāgame yathā ||

paścimāvarjita kiñcidīśānamūrddhagaṃ smaret |
prācitatpuruṣaṃ vaktraṃ hṛdayopari lohitaṃ ||

ghoraṃ guhyo dakṣavāme pṛṣṭhoparisitaṃ tvajaṃ |
oṃ hrauṁ ātmatatveśvarāya śivāya svāhā ||

oṃ hauṁ vidyātatveśvarā śivāya svāhā |
oṃ hauṁ śivatatveśvarāya śivāya svāhā ||

<51a>

oṃ hauṁ makheśvarāya makhaṃ pūraya <2> śūlapāṇaya svāhā |
ityañjali catuṣṭayaṃ namontairvānyodibhyo datvā śivamagniṃ vā vasare visṛjet | 
atrāgnerapi vāsanādibhisarjanāntaṃ rakṣaṇaṃ vidheyaṃ | tathā hi | 

etadantikamevāsya naimittika havi bhujaḥ | kuṇḍajā prāyanaṃ norddha na ca nityaṃ 
visarjanaṃ ||

tadanu prabhumvijñāpayet || 

oṃ bhagavannatiriktaṃ vā hīnaṃ vāyanmayā kṛtaṃ | 
sarvaṃ tadastu sampūrṇaṃ parvaṃdāmanakaṃ mama ||

tato yāgaṃ vākyavadvisarjayet | eka dinadamanepi prāgvat ||

dvādaśasvapi māseṣu pūjayed vamanaiḥ sadā |
śivaṃ kiṃtu vidheścaitra māsottha syāpi khaṇḍanāt ||

guruvarapāraṃparya śrīkaṇṭhānandi veṣṭitaṃ vakṣe | 
yat smaraṇena tu pāśāḥ puṃsirhṛrī kṛtā viṣamāḥ ||

godāvarī tīre śivān madeśādvidyeśā cchrīkaṇṭhādīśayoṣitaḥ ||

<51b>

mādhavādbrahmaṇaskandāt pañcadhā pañca vaktrajaṃ |
bhedādbījapadārthākhyā cchivarudrāṅkayā dvidhā ||

daśāṣṭādaśadhābhinne vividhādhi vistaraṃ |
parādisoḍhāsambandha yumacchivabhāṣitaṃ ||

avatāguruṃ krodhaṃ muṇiṃndurvāsasaṃkramāt ||

prāptaṃ śopi phaṇīndrasya vāsukarbhuvi viśrute |
śrīmadāmadākasthāne prathamevīśvaro bhavet ||

tadvaṃsaprabhavaḥ śakraṇiḥ śrīraṇapaṭuke |
andhagṛhnatsahaśrākṣamathatadvaṃsajo paraḥ ||

śrīpūrvaprādibhāmadhyavāntannaśivasajñakaḥ |
pañcamantratantrardevaḥ sadāśiva iva prabhuḥ ||

āśīdupārjaka guruḥ kila vedi deśe yogolagīti bhuvanatraya gītakīrtiḥ ||

dhānāsṛjanmuninivāsamanarghyamādyaṃ 
kailāśamīśamivaviṣṇuviririvijyeṣṭaṃ ||

taṅgotrāmbuja vodhabhānurabhavacchāntaḥ praśāntaśśivo | 
gonayomupaviṣṭamūrtirucito'pyudbhinna mūrtistataḥ ||

āśīdīśasamaḥ prasiddhamahemāmantrī prabodhaḥ śivo |
dhanyosmācca vabhūvabhūritapasā śrīmānkumāraḥ śivaḥ ||

saurāṣṭra kurcatāgnyutthāyakṣiṇīmasmajāṃmithaḥ |
bhrātṛjyaḥ śrīvāmanāmnāndrabhisikustriṣuruṣe ||

yastakaṃ tritaya trinetra iti hi ślāghya na nāmnānvito |
yo prāndo(?) yanayānkilāśramamima samyak śrite | nantaraṃ ||

yondā(?) dvādaśamūlarājamahiṣīhāsyā nalāndīpitāścakre |
bhogavaśastapāti yuvatī vṛndāvṛtoharniśaṃ | yorājñānumato mahāvrati 
guruvādīndramavyāhataṃ ||

dhīdarpācchiśuvadvijityavidadhe bhitvāsthi mudrāvalīḥ ||

saivaṃ mantravalāntathā karuṇayāpyaspṛśya jātiṃ naraṃ |
sadyomuktamathāsya vaṃśatilakāye nyatrakeṣā dṛśāḥ ||

aṣmāda bhūdacintyānmāśrīśāna śivabhāskaraḥ | 
yena dadyātitaṃ viśvaṃ śisyarasmibhiradbhutaiḥ ||

<52b>

tasmāt sadyaśivorcyaśca pacayatirabhūcchrīmaghoraḥ śivoyāsmā (*)(?) 
tojanetā bhavacakitadhiyāṃ śrīmahānāgamadhyāṃ |

tacchiṣyānāṃ bahutve'pyapaharitamahāmohāsamvartavanmā |
digbhrāntānantakīrtigurunihitapadai'pyuccakairyādhikārī ||

sāyaṃ ṣaṭṭārkadīkṣā gurutaḍadita gaurvādi bhogīndratārkṣāntasmā 
śrīsomasambhu prabhuramita ito dharmasambhurmahātmā || 

yorthī kasmāramatomihira hari śivāśastu cāvyā gamorghaṃ | 
śrutvādāye tu rakṣaṃ sakalajanagurugauḍamabhyatprajātaḥ ||

tasmin bhikṣuvaneveśanasurasarintīrasthamuktiśvare |
śrīmānugratapānarandramakuṭo ghṛtāṃghri padmau vaśī ||

vistāryeśamantrannate hṛtaripāvidvadvinī vālaye kīrtistrīdayite 
dayālurabhavasadvaṇḍa bhuktīśvare sarvāśvaryamaperapāratapaśogambhīre

<53a>

vidyāmbudherīśasyaivajagadvitāyajāgatīmabhyāgatasya svayaṃ ||

<53a>

ṣaṭtriṃśacchidatatva bhāvanaṃ samudbhūta prabhūtottamānandā ghūrṇita 
cittavṛttivasateḥ satkarmaṇāṃ sākṣiṇaḥ |
tasya śrījayasiṃhanāmanṛpatiḥ nārthasya siṣyādbhutasthāsnaḥ śrīvimalaḥ 
śivaśśivaparovārāṇasī saṃśritaḥ ||

yaḥ sābhūktakaviḥ sakakṣiti paterloka dvikhaikāṣṭakeśairvārcādi vidheḥ |
sadarthajaladheddhītodbhavārdvāthadhīḥ ||

gururmalayasiṃhasya magadhādhīsvarasya hi |
śyāmavāro devirājabhūyāśramato'rhataḥ |

kriyāvatāvinītena śrīkaṇṭhādi śivena tu |
dagdhasaṃsāra bījena yā citraḥ śiṣunārthinā ||

athocyateti vimalaṃ prāyaścittaṃ viśuddhaye |
manovākkāyajairbdoṣai grastānāṃ śivayajvanāṃ ||

prāyo nāmatapaḥ proktaṃ cittaṃ niścaya ucyate |
tayo niścaya saṃyogā prāyaścittaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

<53b>

gṛhastho brahmacārī ca prāyaścitti dvidhā sthitaḥ |
pratyekaṃ dvividhaṃ jñeyaṃ sakāmākāmabhedataḥ ||

niḥkāmā tu sakāse tu dviguṇāṃśuddhimādiśet |
bhautikā dviguṇaṃ jñeyaṃ prāyaścittaṃ tu naiṣṭikeḥ ||

sambandhādeśca dharmāśca prasiddhāna vicāyet |
yaddadāti guruḥ śiṣya tena śuddhitmardā bhavet ||

sopi dadyādvalaṃ jñātvā kālaṃ pātraṃ vayo vapuḥ |
prāṇapīḍāntathā yāsaṃ yathāndala bhaga naraḥ ||

dātavyaṃ karmasāreṇa saṃkṣiptaṃ saṃvibhājitaṃ |
anyairvāpi hi kartavyaṃ bhrātṛṇa (*)(?) ṇḍatairapi ||

andhavṛddhā turāndhanvyādhyādi pariḍitān |
teṣāṃ sakṣiptaṃ dātavyaṃ strīṇāṃccāddāma bhairava ||

prāyaścittaṃ yadākabditkartane(?) | śaknuyāt tadā || 

prārthyānyāścaiva kartavyaṃ yathoktā dviguṇaṃ punaḥ |
da (*)(?) rddhaṃ tridaśatādarpājjapāsnānena śuddhyati ||

tadūrddhaṃ pañcamaṃ yāvacchataṃ naktaṃ vidhīyate |
tadūrddhaṃmupakasasya trirātraṃ vāyutadvayaṃ ||

<54a>

homaṃ daśāṃśataḥ kuryādviśāṃśaṃ gaḍḍukājjapāt |
naktaṃ haviṣā bhugyā ca prāyaścittaṃ samāpyate ||

upavāsa vihīnastu marujānāṃ japaḥ smṛtaḥ |
tilamaṅgādṛte samya samyasamyagodhūmako dravau ||

cīnakādeva dhānyañca sarvaśākaṃ tathaiva ca |
svinnaṃ dhānyantathā yanyaṃ mūlyakṣāragaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

devayātrāvivāheṣu yajñaprakaraṇeṣu ca |
utsaveṣu ca sarveṣu spṛṣṭāspṛṣṭirna duṣyate ||

māṃcakāṣṭhenāvikutrya tṛṇaughaśmeni hastinī |
tīrthayātrāvivāhādi sapiṇḍī karaṇādṛte ||

abdamekena kurvīta mahānipātane |
anyanta saruje dehe rājacaura bhayastathā ||

agnivāri bhaye tadvat sṛtikāṃ nāśanastathā |
gurudevāgni kārye ca nityahāni na doṣa bhāk ||

vipre śuddhirddaśāhā syāt kṣatriye dvādaśāhikā |
daśapañcāhikā śuddhi vaiśye sūdrasya māsikā ||

<54b>

patanāt pūrṇagarbhasya suddhi syāt tatkṣaṇātmikādhna arthāgvai cūḍasajñasya 
mṛtādvālānta sūtakaṃ ||

yeṣāṃ tu sūtakaṃ teṣāṃ sparśasaṃcaye norddhataḥ |
yadvā nāmakṛteḥ sadya ekāho dantajanmanaḥ ||

cūḍāyāstridinaṃ proktaṃ tatrāgnya'dhikamāvratāt |
atorddhapūrvacchuddhiḥ sarvarṇeṣviyaṃ sthitiḥ ||

mṛtakādau pṛthakyākaṃ kuyyādyoganataissaha |
tyakta na cedaśo yāti tadā śuddhirbhavettryahāt ||

jīvanjāto yadi mṛyāt mṛto vā jāyate yadi |
sāvā śauca na kartavyaṃ sūtī saucaṃ samācaret ||

śavena śuddhyate vṛddhirna vṛddhyācchudhyate śavaḥ |
sarveṣāṃ vṛddhivaddhānau praveśyāṃ nāsti sūtakā ||

ahastvadantakanyāyā dattāyāṃ dvidinaṃ bhavet |
svaśradisu ca vijñeyaṃ māturānyāñca mātule ||

syālake tatsute mitre drauhitre bhagignīpatau |
jāmātrādau mṛte vāpi snānādeva viśuddhyati ||

ajātadante vṛṣale mṛte garbhacyute'thavāśuddhiraikādaśāhena jñātvānyatra 
prakalpayet ||

deśāntare pṛthak piṇḍe snānaṃ syāt tadguruṃ vināṃ |
manyastacālabhṛgvagni salilādi mṛteṣu ca ||

girāṃ vācyavahārasya bhedoyaṃ trāntare giriḥ |
mahānadī vā bhavate tadveśāntamīritaṃ ||

ajātadantā vālāye garbhādye ca viniḥsmṛtāḥ |
teṣānāstyagni saṃskāro nodakādi kriyā kvacit ||

mṛte'patyepitākurpyā devakarātramabhojanaṃ |
pañcagavyayutaṃ mātā tatrirātraṃ yathā vidhiḥ ||

dāne yajñe vivāhe ca saṃgrāme daśaviplave |
āpadyapicakaṣṭāyāṃ sadyaḥ saucaṃ vidhīyate ||

āture snānamāpanne daśakṛtvo hyanā turaṃḥ |
spṛṣṭvā spṛṣṭvā vahiḥ snāyāt tadāsau śuddhimāpnuyāt ||

ācārya varaṇorddhantu yāvadyajña sthitirbhavet |
atra saṃmparkasūnyabhya na syātāṃ mṛtasūtake ||

nirvāṇadīkṣitānāntu sūtake naiva vidyate |

<55b>

vidyate sūtakaṃ teṣāṃ lokadīkṣānusārataḥ ||

śikhācchedonayatrāstimādīkṣā lokikī smṛtāḥ |
antaryāgaḥ prakartavyo lokikaireva dīkṣitaiḥ ||

japapradakṣiṇādīnikattavyāṇi prayatnataḥ |
sūtake mṛtake yadvannārī ṛtumatī tathā ||

nāmaṃ śuddhāyadrudra sarvāvasthā svapi kvacit |
prathamehani cāṇḍālī dvitīye brahmaghātakī ||

tṛtīye rajakī proktā caturthe khalaśuddhyati |
rātrostriyorayo me janmamṛtyośca janminaḥ ||

pūrvameva dinaṃ grāhyaṃ yāvannodayete raviḥ |
bālabālisavṛddhānāṃ nṛpānāṃ vyādhitātmanāṃ ||

strīnāntu kārukāṇāntu prāyaścittaṃ na vidyate |
apamānādathakrodhā snehātparibhavādbhayāt ||

udvāpya mṛyate nārī puruṣo vā kathaṃcanaḥ |
aśucyā nāmanarakāstatra te yānti mānavāḥ ||

pūyamāṇita sampūrṇe atamasidāruṇe |
ṣaṣṭhi varṣa sahaśrāṇi hatvātmānaṃ vaśennaraḥ ||

<56a>

tīrthayātrāḥ bhṛgauḥ pātaḥ sanyāso vahni bhakṣaṇaṃ |
etāni paśujātīnāṃ dīkṣitau na samācaret ||

rātrau dānañca pūjāñca vubhukṣuḥ parivarjayet |
vināgrahe puṇye tathā vai sādhakeṣu ca ||

pūjayitvā pramādena gāyatryaṣṭa śatañjapet |
mumukṣo sarvadā sa śiva pūjā na vāryate ||

pavitra luptau dve lakṣaghorasyaindu vrataṃ tathā |
dhyāmalope caitra māsa puṇyaṃ nāsya cchivājñayā ||

dhenuṃ pramādato hutvā hyaghoraṃ lakṣataḥ śuciḥ |
kāmatoreta utsṛjya japedvāmaśatadvayaṃ ||

kṣauramaithunadughnavāṃtpādau rūpiṇaṃ plutaḥ |
śavadhūmacitāsṛtī svakākādyaiśca dūṣitaḥ ||

kṛtāhnikaśca duḥṣṭasnātvā kriyāṃvinā |
bhuktvākīṭādi vā snāto devaṃ naivārcayet kvacit ||

akāmataḥ prasuptasya sukrādaśyandane sati |
snātvā purā sa cailastu astra mantraṃ śatañjapet ||

<56b>

purvāparāntu yaḥ saṃdhyā sadyojāta sa kṛjjapet |
ahorātraṃ kṛtaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇā deva nasyati ||

karmanā manasā vācā miṣyokto guhyakaṃ śataṃ |
reto sūtrapurīṣe vā daivārjjaśce ca tajjapet ||

aghora japate yastu kṛṣṇāṣṭamyāṃ sakṛnniṣi |
mucyate sarvapāpebhyo nirdvandvo nirujo bhavet ||

sakṛtsmaraṇamātreṇa sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet |
āvartya pañcavāraṃ tu sarvatīrtha phalaṃ labhet ||

sarvayajñaphalānīhaṃ saptavārānu kīrtanāt |
trisaptavāramāvartya pūjānte niyamena tu || 

pūjā phalaṃ samastaṃ tu prāpnuyānnātrasaṃśayaḥ |
aghorātnāparaṃ mantraṃ kalimāsādyasiddhidaṃ ||

saptavārābjapedvaktra dīkṣito māsa bhakṣaṇāt |
abhakṣabhakṣaṇe viṃśatya vācya vaṣane daśaḥ ||

gurunindāpavāde tu mājjāntajalamakṛt |
grasthāpahāraṇe tacca cchataṃ saptaṃ tu matstriyā ||

spṛṣṭhetna sitepi pañcabhaikṣyaṃ bhyaktaika bhojane |

<57a>

rudrakoṭiṃ tu yo vipro japedrudrasya sannidhau ||

sakṛttatpuruṣajaptvā kalānārghanti ṣoḍaśīṃ |
yo nindeta śivaṃ mohāttacchāstraṃ yogiṇantathā ||

kīṭakeṣāpavidvānna dūṣitavāpi kenacit |
khādeccāṣṭaśateśānaṃ sasakṛccakramājjapet ||

grahaṇe candrasūryābhyāṃ viṣṭaveṣu ca nityasaḥ |
īśānaṃ japate yastu pāpa tasya na vidyate ||

karmaṇā manasā vācā pāpa kṛtvā tu mohataḥ |
gṛñjanādīnya bhakṣāṇi bhakṣāṇi bhaumānikavakīni ca ||

palāṇḍulaśunaṃ japtvā īśānaṃ tu sakṛtsmaret |
maṭhapratigrahe kuryā japaṃ ghoraṃsyalakṣakaṃ ||

yatrādau syādguroḥ sthānaṃ paścāt prāsāda kalpanā |
tanta(?)yovanamityuktaṃ manyathā maṭhamādiśet ||

sarveṣāmeva pāpānāṃ saṅkare samupasthite |
pañcabrahmāṇi tu japedekaṃ vā bahūrūpiṇaṃ ||

upavāsastathāsnānaṃ pañcagavyā śatajapaḥ |
homaścaiva malaṃ hanti sarvaśaṅkarajaṃ nṛṇāṃ ||

vratasya ca kriyāyāñca niyamasya ca lopane |
gāyatryaṣṭa śate naiva acchidraṃ tādṛśaṃ punaḥ ||

sakṛtsaṃdhyāvilope tu ajātasya śataṃ japet |
trikālalopāntrikāla lopāntri guṇaṃ sopavāsaṃ sakāmataḥ ||

saṃdhyā traya paribhraṣṭaḥ śivaikādaśikā trayaṃ |
japtvāviśuddhimāpnoti snānahīnaśca tāṃ japet ||

anasthi prāṇisaṃhātaṃ hatvaikādaśikāṃ japet |
hatvā ca pakṣiṇassarvāstrirekādeśikā kṣapet ||

pañca brahmāgni vāṅgāni śivaṃ ca paramākṣayā |
adhītya svargamāpnoti viditvāmucyate bhṛśaṃ ||

parvaṇya pūjya deveśaṃ gurumagni ca bhaktitaḥ |
adatvā ca valintatra śivaṃ syāṣṭaśataṃ japet ||

patrapuṣpaṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ mannayānādyamauṣadhaṃ |
anivedya vubhuñjano padāhārāya kalpitaṃ ||

śivāṣṭa śatajāpyena pūjayā ca viśuddhyati |

<58a>

japed daśasahaśraṃ tu sacchṛdrasya pramāpane ||

yo mohāccaiva pāpiṣṭā guruṇāṃ sa pathaṃ kṛtaṃ |
dadāti cānyo duṣṭātmā tāvubhau narakaṃ vrajet ||

kṣutadyumbhitakāśe vā dakṣiṇaśravaṇaṃ kare |
spṛṣṭvā nāsagratonyeva spṛśanvighnānna jāyate ||

sarvadā sarvakāryakṣutaniṣṭhīvanādiṣu |
kṛtvaunnamaḥ śivāyeti mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ ||

pañcapātakayuktānāṃ darśanaparivarjayet |
alāpādayutācchuddhi dviguṇosparśato matā ||

śayanādvyayutācchuddhi bhojanāllakṣataḥ śuciḥ |
bauddhacārvākasaṃsparśācchivanindā pareṣu ca ||

sacchāstra duṣakānāñca patitānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
samparke tu jape ghorantathā digambarādibhiḥ ||

saṃkhādīnāṃ bhavacchuddhistuśairvāmathitena vā |
śruvādi carupātrāṇāṃ muṣalolukhalasya ca ||

sūrpagorasabhāṇḍānā śuddhirusnanavāriṇā |
sṛṅgāsthidārudantānāṃ tatkṣṇaṇaiḥ pariśodhanaṃ ||

<58a>

manyaśmatejasavādbhiḥ stāmramamlena vāriṇā |
kāṃśāmamlena sarvaṃ vā carmakāśāya vāriṇā ||

prokṣaśuddhyatyasaṃdehāducchiṣṭaspṛṣṭajājanaṃ |
tuṃvādi caṇḍapātrāṇā gauvā'lairvārigharśanāt ||

dāravaṃ lohako ghṛṣṭaṃ takṣaṇādvā viśuddhyati |
carmaṇārajju vastrāṇāṃ śuddhimyātkṣāravāriṇāṃ ||

pitṛdaivāyayuktānāṃ pratyahaṃ saucamiṣyate |
tyāge paridhānavastrāṇāṃ prāvaraṇasya malāgame ||

rajakakṣālitaṃ vastraṃ punadvautaṃ viśuddhyati |
satyāvāco manaḥ pūtaṃ sadācīrṇāḥ kriyā śubhāḥ ||

āhataṃ dhāturuktañca yacca prakṣālitaṃ mṛdā |
acchinnāgrañca yadvastraṃ pavitraṃ tadati smṛtaṃ ||

nagnasyātmalavadvāśā nagnakaupīnake valaḥ |
vadhnīyānnāśurīṃ kakṣāṃ daivapaitrya ca karmaṇi ||

ekavastreṇa yatsnānaṃ suryācchiddhena caiva hi |
snānaṃ tu na bhavetaddhi śriyā ca parihīyate ||

śuddhiścodakabhāṇṭhānāṃ paryagnikenātmikā |
tṛśādikañca yatkiñcit kāṣṭhaṃ vā prākṣikaṃ śuciḥ ||

mārjanollakhanaiśśikai gonivāśāṅjalena ca |
iti pañca vidhāśuddhi bhūmekāryā vijñānatāḥ ||

tyajennirmālya sadyarśādbhāṇḍaṃ mṛddheṇu saṃbhavaṃ |
kathitaṃ śuddhyate kṣīraṃ dadhiśuddhirnigadyate ||

dadhipātrāntare kṛtvā vikṣipetadanantaraṃ |
annādi lepanirmuktaṃ prokṣaṇācchayyate dadhiḥ ||

sutaptasya śrutasyātha suddhirājyasya kīrtitāḥ |
evaṃ mapuguḍādīnāṃ prokṣaṇādagni yogataḥ ||

nirmālya sparśane tyājyamalyadravyaṃ tathauṣadhaṃ |
sa vikāraṃ tu yattoyaṃ tathaikṣu hiṃgujīrakaṃ ||

saindhavādyaṃ sa karpūraṃ kaṭukādyaṃ saṇḍulaṃ |
ghṛṣṭañca candanaṃ bhaśma jñātvā dravya valāvalaṃ ||

dhānyādyaṃ prokṣitaṃ śuddhyatyevaṃ manyatra lakṣayet |
tūlikā copadhanāni puṣpaṃ raktāmvarāṇi ca ||

śoṣayitvā tapetāni sucīni tu sparśasyādvāṇaliṅgādenirmālyādyairyavā kvacit ||

<59b>

devavisṛjyathātraṃsthaṃ saṃsnāpyā camya snāpayet ||

pātrāntarasthaṃ svācamya bhūyaḥ saṃsnāpya pūjayet |
etaccale calepyetat snānā camanapūrvakaṃ ||

triṃśatāghorataḥ śuddhirliṅgacchāyā viladyāne |
sahaśrālluṭhite śuddhirdviguṇāparivartanāt ||

tricatuluṭhite liṅge vivṛtte tu mahītale |
śuciścaivā yute naiva lakṣātsvabhra cyute śuci ||

dvyayutādabhighāte syādadūre vāyutāddhruvaṃ |
pādasparśalane yatrya yuktāddhūlinārddhataḥ ||

tryayutācchlaśmaduṣṭe tu dvyayutāntu tadambhasā |
sūtrasūtrodake naiva lakṣādvitpādataḥ śuci ||

raktaśukra rajasparśāllakṣārddhātsuddhimādiśet |
viṣvāgarte nipātācca sārddhalakṣācchucirmataḥ ||

sthirasyāt mūlanāllakṣā śuddhisaṃsthāpanāttathā |
āpatsutyakudiglakṣaṃ japet koṭiṃ tu kāmataḥ ||

sasamudgakaliṅge tu pramādātpatite sati |

<60a>

tryayutārddhaṃ mataṃ haste kalpyanyūnā'dhikaṃ tataḥ |
samudgaka vihīne tu pūrvoktādviguṇācchuciḥ ||

ayutādagninālīḍhe yadikāntirnahīyate |
kānti hīne śucirlakṣāt parityāge kṛte pare ||

vyaṅgitapyarthavicchāyenadīgartāddipātataḥ |
hṛte naṣṭa nipatite mahāgartapramādataḥ ||

svakākalīḍhite liṅge nīte vā śucibhistathā |
hṛterājñā taskarairvā svapacairvātha sevite ||

viruddhavargadvitaye sparśetpāśāvidhīyate |
lakṣamekaṃ japedyatnānta hrāyaṃ sthāpayet punaḥ ||

sthaṇḍile pūjisamyat krasādāda visarjite |
āhṛtya mantrā tatpuṣpā ghoraṃ pañcaśataṃ huṇet ||

japet pañca sahaśrā vā tathā liṅgapi daivataḥ |
viśīrṇe sarvabhāvena prāgvallakṣatrayaṃ vidhau ||

samantraṃ cālayelliṅgaṃ liṅgabhedī bhave naraḥ |
śaivāḥ pāśupatāye ca kāpālavratadhāriṇaḥ ||

ekaṃ tu phanayitvāpi hatasyādbhuvana trayaṃ |
atha daivājjaṭonāntu vayanaighoralakṣakaṃ ||

tathākṣamerumullaghya śivaśāṣṭa śatañjapet |
aivaṃ vairākṣa sūtraṃsya prāgukta liṅgapādataḥ ||

liṅgāṣṭāṃśena ghaṇṭāyāmaparādheṣu liṅgavat |
brāhmaṇādi caturvarṇairasai vai sveṣṭa liṅgake ||

ekadvitricatuthyantai saṃspṛṣṭe tu śatācchuciḥ |
puruṣā ghoravāmājā jātīśā brāhmaṇāditaḥ sādhāraṇopya ghorastu īśaḥ 
sādhāraṇaḥ paraḥ ||

kaivartavargasaṃspṛṣṭe sveṣṭaliṅge yutācchuciḥ |
vāmadakṣiṇa kaulaistu spṛṣṭe liṅge yutañjayet ||

svaśroto dīkṣitai liṅgaṃ yadāspṛṣṭaṃ na doṣa sāk |
homārthe vā guraurathai liṅgārthe pācitaṃ tu yat ||

mohena tṛṣṇayā vātha bhakṣayet taṃ tu durmatiḥ |
japellakṣaṃ sa pādantu tasya śuddhi sadā bhavet ||

athavā śivanirmālyaṃ praṇālaṃ vāthaladyoyet |
ayutānātrayaṃ japtvā gaḍukānāṃ śatāṣṭakaṃ ||

<61a>

kāmatastu viśuddhyeta akāmādayuta dvayaṃ |
yatkurvanti guronindāṃ dīkṣitānāṃ śivasya ca ||

tasmāsthānādvrajedūraṃ sadyojātaśatañjayet |
nindakānvinihatyapi hatyayāna vilipyate ||

akāmāllīghitācchāyā guruvahni tapaśvināṃ |
jape tu triśataṃ ghoraṃ gokanyā sadvije śataṃ ||

ekāha pūjālopena sahaśraṃ madhyamaṃ japet |
akāmataḥ pramādācca kāmato dviguṇācchuciḥ ||

upavāsadvayāccaiva śucimāhurna cānyathā |
triskārapūjanaṃ yeṣāmekakālamathāpi vā ||

prāyaścitta samaṃ teṣā nanyūnaṃ nādhikaṃ bhavet |
ekāha tu samārabhya yāvaddaśadināvadhiḥ ||

varddhayet triśataṃ prokṣādvāmasvai gaḍḍukāni ca |
pakṣaika lopataścaivadvyayutaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ japet ||

dviguṇaṃ māsalope tu dvyayutaṃ varddhayet tataḥ |
māsi māsi viśuddyarthaṃ yāvat samvatsarāvadhiḥ ||

nityavaddhyamalope tu prāyaścittaṃ samādiśet |
rakṣite'gnau hi nirvāṇe japedghoramupoṣṭhitaḥ || 

sa śivepi hi nirvāṇe trirātraṃ samupoṣitaḥ |
japedvā juhuyādvāpi vahurūpaṃ praśāntaye ||

aṣṭamyādiṣu yā pūjā japahomādikā kriyā |
catupañcamaṃ parivattayet ||

avisarjita pātre tu bhagnecārtha vivartite |
śata dvayāt sahaśrācca tadarddhāt kramasaḥ śuciḥ ||

gaṇānnaṃgaṇikānnaṃ ca patitvānnāśane tathā |
sīmanto nayanai bhuktvā guruśamyāśanādikaṃ ||

bhramabhrāmādādāruhya sahaśrandakṣiṇaṃ japet |
niśedhātmatsya madhvādau pramādādbhakṣite'yutaṃ ||

jvamadyaṃ kvaśive bhaktiḥ kvāsaucaṃtkabhavārcanaṃ |
madirāmāṃsaraktāṇāṃ dūre tiṣṭhati śaṅkaraḥ ||

kādaṃvaryasanaṃ daivādadīkṣate'lpakaṃ yadi |
pravṛttatvācca sudrasya tasyād doṣāya vāruṇī ||

maithunāhārapāṇānāṃ niyamasyā parakṣaṇāt |

<62a>

abhyaṅgapāṇavastrādī mahaśrārdhena śuddhyati |
adhaḥ śayanasaṅkalpya lopādastraṃ japecchataṃ ||

dvādaśaikādaśāha tu triśataṃ dakṣiṇaṃ japet |
aṣṭamaṃgalake dhuṃrale(?) bhuktvā vāśāta japet ||

nāmaprāśana niskāme bhuktvā vaktraśataṃ japet |
caturthikānnaṃ bhuktvā tu japed guhyaṃ tu pūrvavat ||

pākādiṣu kratuṣṭhannaṃ bhoktavyaṃ pāvanaṃ yataḥ |
cauḍe vrate sa godāne vivāhe ca na doṣabhāk ||

bhojyamannaṃ trayāṇāntu mudrāṇāna kadācanaḥ |
saucācārasamāyuktā ye rudrāmadyapāne hiḥ ||

rudrārcana ratā bhaktā bhojyāste cāntya jāna hi |
teṣāmapi nirodhānta bhuktvāpādhi vaśāt kvacit ||

sadyojātaśataṃ japtvā saṃyataḥ śuddhimarcchati |
abhojyā vā tyajau jātaṃ kaṣṭaṃmāgne tadāyadi ||

bhuktvā ghorasahaśrantu japedarddhamakāmataḥ |
kapālaliṅgināṃ bhuktvā putadīkṣāṃ tu kārayet |

<62b>

svajāti dīkṣita spṛṣṭastadācamya viśuddhyati |
ācamyādīkṣite nāpi svajātī saśataṃ japet ||

samīpadīkṣitasparśāt prāyaścittantu pūrvavat |
tasmin dīkṣite spṛṣṭa japet snātvā śatatrayaṃ ||

evamevāntare sparśā dīkṣitasya tarasya vā |
śatatrayaṃ catuṣkaṃ vā japet snātvā hyupoyoṣitaḥ ||

itare pādahīnaṃ tu prāyaścittaṃ prakurvate |
trirātramatyajasparśāt sahaśrāṇi japed daśaḥ ||

kṛcchrāghorajapaḥ kāryo'yutaṃścāṇḍālasaṅgamāt |
jñātvā jñātvā yathāsparśa prāyaścittaṃ tathā caret ||

ucchiṣṭaṃ tu samānāṇāṃ bhuktvāpoṣya śucirbhuvet |
sahaśramayutaṃ caiva tathāmadhya mahīnayoḥ ||

dvitrirātropavāsaśca varṇṇaucchiṣṭasājane |
jaghanyocchiṣṭaṃ saṃparkā devaṃ daśaguṇaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

yonnaṃ nāmantrito bhuṃkte yasya varṇasya dīkṣitaḥ |
tarjātīśasvajātīśau japtvaikatra viśudhyati ||

<63a>

eko dvau ca trayaścaiva divaśāstasya śuddhaye |
kṣatravitmudrajātīnāṃ japasyānukramena tu ||

jemanedendriya śrāvaśauca snāne atha dvidhā |
āvāmaṅgā care ghora sahasraṃ tu japedabhuk ||

snānaṃ homaṃ japaṃ pūjāmajīrṇe varjayedbudhaḥ |
jīrṇe snātvā tu gāyatryā japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||

pītāvaṣiṣṭaṃ yadvāri pibeccet pramādataḥ |
samupoṣyaniśāmekāṃ pañcagavya pibedbudhaḥ ||

nakhakaṇṭhaka matsyāṃśca sambūkañca kapardanaṃ |
navāmbu pītvā copoṣya pañcagavyapibedapi ||

pauṣādi caturaumāsā na kāle varṣanaḥ śuciḥ |
bhayedvipuladoṣāya vaiśākhādauna bodakaṃ ||

mudvādaśāhasyurbhṛmiṣṭanavāṃgo mahiṣyajā |
yajñopavītarahito yo bhuṃkte vāpi vedathe ||

upoṣya japtvā ghoraṃ sa pañcagavyena śuddhyati |
nirmālyā bhakṣaṇe jāte pramādādayutaṃ japet ||

<63b>

aghorasya na cānyasya kāmādyogena śuddhyati |
gurucaṇḍamadbhaśājñāṃ bhaṅge lakṣaṃ japedapi ||

gurvāgni vidyāpīṭhānāṃganīnāgendra yogināḥ |
mātṛyakṣāṃ vikādīnāṃ na nirmālyaṃ śiva yathā ||

ratnāsthi svarṇaliṅgeṣu pratimāyāṃ pradakṣiṇe |
vyākhyā svapi cale citre nirmālyaṃ naivaduṣyati ||

pūjāyāmagnadhūpādi gandhodīpa prabhāṇi ca |
nadīpravāha nirmālyaṃ naiva duṣyati karhacit ||

sthirajale sthale nityaṃ nirmālyaṃ śrotasi kṣipet |
śukṣārdra(?) vasanā vāpi gāyatrīṃ na jale japet ||

sūryā nalātmikāṃ nityaṃ virodhādvārite jasoḥ |
oṃkārādyāścaturviṃśākṣarāntenati varjitāḥ ||

gāyatryarkā gatājaptā(?) viṣṭāvāntarkamaṇḍalaṃ |
oṃ hauṃ hrīṁ vātha gāyatrai namontā bhīṣṭadā'ghahā ||

liṃge pratisthita sadya calasthira sajñake |
catuśrī karmaparyantaṃ nirmālyā dine doṣakṛt ||

<64a>

devasvaṃ devatā dravyaṃ naivedyañca nivedyakaṃ |
caṇḍadantañca nirmālyaṃ dānādasyāpi rākṣasaḥ ||

mātaṅgobhakṣaṇāt siddhirhānirlanato bhavet |
gandhagrāhī vṛkaścaiva svaparo'vidhidāhataḥ ||

sparśana bhavati strītvaṃ savaratvañca vikraye |
lanena samasparśaḥ samo bhakṣaṇe vikrayau ||

yannirmālyai na saṃspṛṣṭaṃ tadbhujā puruṣeṇa vā |
pādona tatra pūrvoktaṃ sparśalana bhakṣaṇe ||

anuṣaṅga prapiṣṭaṃ yaccandanādi pramādataḥ |
tannirmālyañcaturthāśaṃ siddhaliṅgādināmaṣu ||

ekabhaktaṃ tryahaṃ kuryāt tryahaṃ caiva ayācitaṃ |
tryahañca nakta me nityaṃ tryahaṃ vai mārutāśanaḥ ||

eka (*)(?) cchrā mahā'padmaḥ prājāpatya iti smṛtaḥ |
tryahamuṣṇaṃ pivedvāri tryahaṃ kṣīreṇa bhojanaṃ ||

tryahamuṣṇaghṛtaṃ pītvā tryahaṃ caike valaṃ yadā |
taptakṛcchra samākhyāto atikṛcchraṃ śuṇuṣvataḥ ||

kṣīrasya tripalaṃ pāṇaṃ divasānekaviṃśati |

<64b>

brahmacārī samādhisthaḥ kṣāntiśīla parāyaṇaḥ ||

ahorātraṃ na bhuñjīta upavāsasya lakṣaṇaṃ |
maithunasyā samācārastadacintarmajalpanaṃ ||

lakṣaṇaṃ brahmacaryasya samastaindriya saṃyamaḥ |
brahmacaryaṃ japomānaṃ kṣāntirāhāralāghavaṃ ||

ityetattapaśorūpaṃ sughoraṃ (***)(?) kṣaṇaṃ |
dvādaśāhaṃ nirāhāraḥ parākastriguṇomahān ||

māsārddhaṃ grāsavṛddhisyācchuklakṛṣṇa ca hrāsayet |
cāndrāyaṇa vidheḥ proktau jalādeva jalātmakaḥ ||

catvāriṃśatsamāyuktaṃ piṇḍāṇāṃ hi śatadvayaṃ |
adyātmāsādi paryanta yadi cāndrāyaṇaṃstvasau ||

svaśāstrotthāni kāryāṇi vratāni niyamāni ca |
paratantro'ditānyatra varjanīyāniyantataḥ ||

saṃhitā pārago mantrī yaḥ ka(?)rotīha pātakaṃ |
sarvaṃ tadbhaśmasātkṣipraṃ mantraśaktyā karoti saḥ ||

vyāsastvasya mayākāri prāyaścitta samuccaye |

<65a>

ukta eṣa paśu dṛmbhiḥ ragamyo dāmano vidhiracintyamahatvaḥ |
devadānava camūdamanena nāmamasya varaharejasya ||

[vimalāvatyāṃ dāmanavidhiścaturthaḥ] || grantha <244>||


brahmāpaindrādi devāḥ surataru vipine svaṃpaśutvaṃ vimoktuṃ kliṣṭāḥ 
kaṣṭaistayobhirjalapavanāghośanālaghavantaḥ |
dīkṣāṃ sthitvā vṛkoṭiḥ śivasadṛśaguṇavyaktaye yatpraśādātta 
dhyāyetstāṃ pravakṣe nijamṛḍavaśatau saṃvaśanakāśikāyāṃ ||

devadāruvane tasmin pratyayaudyāpi dṛśyate |
dantakāṣṭhaśikhāṃ vṛdhyā jaṃtau dīkṣā kṛtau mahān ||

brahmādi sthāvarāṃ toyaṃ dehī yaḥ kaści dīkṣate |
saivīndīkṣādhinānasyāt sodhikārīharārcane ||

tataḥ prabhṛttimaktausau yadāghrātaḥ śivecchayāḥ |
kiṃ tu dīkṣādibhirliṅgairnavinājñāyate tu saḥ ||

devāṃ śarīriṇāṃ śaktiḥ patatya vinivṛttaye |
teṣāṃ talliṅgamaucchrakyamuktau dveṣo bhava sthitau ||

<65b>

bhaktiśca śivabhakteṣu śraddhātacchāstrake vidhau |
anetānumitiḥ śiṣṭa hetauḥ sthūradhiyāmapi ||

paśuvṛdyogasthidvānāṃ karmavyakti dvayaṃ samaṃ |
jyeṣṭhādi phalayogyānāṃ sādhikārāṣṭamuktiṣu ||

upāpādaraṣaiśiṣyā mṛyetatatrayaṃ punaḥ |
īśadadvanivarte tu rodhakasvetamaḥ yate ||

bhavantye tāni cihnāṇi kiñcicchiṣṭe vaṭehināṃ |
rudramantrapatīśānayaṃdabhājobhavantite ||

sthitauṣānanu gṛhnāti gurumāsthāya ciddhataḥ |
mandādi śaktive citryāntatsālokyādigānatha ||

yātvimo ca yeti svāyośikhāḥ sadyo bhavantite |
saṃkṛtaudāsamudbhūtā ṣaṇavaḥ patayo'thavā ||

svāpe dhyāstathādhayatvodhayogyāmrādhyā bhrusvanyā ca yatkarmikarmā 
māyāśaktī tryakti yogyāḥ prakurvanyasyat sarvayadyathā vastujātaṃ ||

<66a>

dharmādharmasame daivācchaivīṃśaśaktiyatedyadā |
tadāsya niyataṃ dhyānaṃ dīkṣāpratyupajāyate ||

kohakimātmakaścaikimidaṃ duḥkhapañjaraṃ |
iti sañcintya bahuśo mumukṣu gurumanviyān ||

tamārādhya tatastuṣṭāddīkṣāmāsādyaśāṅkarīṃ |
tatkṣaṇādupabhogyadvā dehapāte śivaṃ vrajet ||

rudraśca rudraśaktiśca guruśceti samaṃ trayaṃ |
bhaktyā prayasyate yastu tasmai dīkṣā citāparā ||

śiṣyenāpi tadāgrāhyā yadā santoṣito guruḥ |
śarīradravyavijñānaśraddhākarmaguṇādibhiḥ ||

cākṣusyādi prabhedena dīkṣāpyanekadhā yathā |
nimīla nayane dhyātvā paraṃ tatvaṃ sunirmalaṃ ||

tataḥ paśyecchi saṃddhyarthaṃ dīkṣāṣārākṣuṣāṃ śivāḥ |
haste śivaṃ purādhyātvā brahmāṅga sahitaṃ śiraṃ ||

saṃspṛśecchiṣya dehaṃ tu śiraḥspṛṣṭvādikaṃ guruḥ |
sparśadīkṣā bhavedevaṃ layabhogavidākṛtāḥ ||

<66b>

cittatatve samāpāya pare tejopavṛṃhitān |
uccaret saṃhitā mantrā vāgdīkṣā karaṇaṃ vibhoḥ ||

tacca nityaṃ na śakyanyat saktināccetanāṃcanaḥ |
mānasaṃ vidhimāsṛtya mānasī jñānakasyasau ||

śāstrasya satpradāyāntu śāstradīkṣā tvanekadhā |
vedhādyā veśadā proktā yogadā śivadāyinī ||

guruprasādādālabhyet sarvāvaṣṭa(?) ca varjitāḥ |
dīkṣā hyetā viśiṣyāśca viśiṣṭaphalakākṣiṇāṃ ||

prāṇināmoharurojyā(?) kṛtāḥ sadguruṇāhitā |
tatvai ṣaṭtriṃśatārddhena tadarddhanātha pañcabhiḥ ||

tribhi (*)(?) kādibhirvāśrīnetrabhaṣṭārakādiṣu |
kalābhirbhuvanairvaṇaiḥ padairmantraiśca śāstragaiḥ ||

prakāreramīṣāṃsvaisamastavyastavistaraiḥ |
vadhūdhāsaṃsthitāhotrī savījāvījato dvidhā ||

sā vācāḥ samayā vījaṃ tatsahāyāsavījikāḥ |
nirvījātairvinirmuktā nirvījāpi dvidhā punaḥ ||

<67a>

sadyonirvāṇa hyekā dvitīyā dehayā tataḥ |
caturddhā śakti pātena tulye naiva phalaṃ prati ||

tīvratarastathā tīvro mandomandataropi ca |
sasvomuktyāmnarcchapārakaṃ dhyādromāñca tastathā ||

dṛṣṭvā śiṣyaṃ jarāsrastaṃ vyādhinā paripīḍitaṃ |
uktamayya tatastvenaṃ paratatve niyojayet ||

dvividhā syāt sa bījāpi tatrādyā śivadharmiṇī |
putrakā cāryayo mukhyā dharmādharma kṣayakarī ||

iṣṭāpūrtādi nirate sādhake lokadharmiṇī ||

śivadharmiṇyaṇau mūlaṃ śivadharma phalaṃ śriyaḥ |
hitatarāvinābhaṃgaṃ tannaurāvilayādbhavāṃ ||

bhogabhūmiṣu sarvāsu duḥskṛtāṃ śahate śati |
dehāntarāṇimādyarthaṃ śiṣṭeṣṭālokadharmiṇī ||

yo patrā'bhilasedbhāgāṃ sa tatraiva niyojitaḥ |
siddhibhāgmantrasāmarthyā tattatvābhyāṃ sa tastathā ||

mantramudrārthadravyāṇāṃ homaḥ sādhāraṇa smṛtaḥ |

<67b>

rāśanābhedato bhinna śiṣyāṇāñca gurostathā |
brahmacaryādi pitrādi mātṛśca svasnuyā divā ||

dāsyādi śaktāśaktādi saṅkalpyai vattu dīkṣayet |
sādhikarāṇanadhikārā dīkṣābhūyo dvidhā bhavet ||

nityanaimittike kāmya syādyathā vikṛtaḥ sadā |
sāsā'dhikārādīkṣākṣāsādhakārāryayoḥ paraṃ ||

putrakaḥ sa tathā tadva nirvījā dīkṣitaśca yaḥ |
dīkṣā nityaika kartṛtvā teṣāmanadhikārikāṃ ||

bālavālisavṛddhastrī bhāgabhukṣyādhitādayaḥ |
nirvījadīkṣitāstvate bhakṣe kārya vaśena vā ||

bhūyaścānekadhā hotrī bhaven mantra prabhedataḥ |
brahmabhirbrahmadīkṣāsyādaṃgairapyaṃgimī smṛtāḥ ||

śaktibhiḥ śaktidīkṣoktā hṛddīkṣā hṛdayānunā |
mūrtidīkṣāmūrtiyaiḥ syāccakraiśeśca tadīsvarīḥ ||

gaṇādhipairgaṇeśānī lokapālaistadīśvarī |

<68a>

rudrairganaimātṛbhiśca bhagiṇībhirayit kvacit |
evamādyā smṛtāmiśrā mantraijñeyāstadātmikāḥ ||

ātmāpyanekadhā proktāstatrādyaḥ sakalo mataḥ |
māyākarmamalopeta kalādya ca nigocaraḥ ||

karmāśuddhiṣu taścānyā māyāyāṃ pralayākalaḥ |
māyorddhaṃ śuddhavidyādho malamātrā vṛtoparaḥ ||

jñānākalasthitāstvetā carugrāhyā parātmanaḥ |
śivasya niskalasyāti tīvraśakti nipātataḥ ||

māyātatvaṃ jagadvījamavināśye śivātmakaṃ |
bilvekakamalaṃ sūkṣmasanādyavyayamīśvaraḥ ||

karmatadvividhaṃ bhogyaṃ dharmādharmātmakaṃ paśoḥ |
ābhogasthāpitaḥ dvidyātphaladvaya virodhi ca ||

tadekaṃ prāṇināṃ mūlamanādi niviḍa mahat |
pratyonmastha svakālāntāyādhi śaktisamūhavat ||

malaśaśaktyadhīkāraḥ sthitiḥ nivṛtti bhedataḥ |
tathānya bhedairbhūyastācātmāneha prapañcitaḥ ||

nandādi śaktipātena jñātasya śakalātmanaḥ |
gurumūrtiḥ śivakuryāddīkṣāṃ hautrīṃ kalātmikāṃ ||

jaṅkikuṇḍalinī tridhā sadyatitocchalādi sūṣmārparāvadātāmapi caraṃ kathamapi 
yo nāmitatvaṃ śiva |
vaṃdhukadvitirsūdarāṃbhagavatīsiṃhāsinī sundarī tāvatyā mahiṣāsura 
pramathīṇīdhādibhimuktaye ||

tavakalaṅkaḥ puruṣasya tathā svavidbhāvaḥ |
śuddhiprajātatulāyāṃ dīkṣāto brahmatetyato mukhyāt ||

pratyaṣatojāmāyārddhanvanaviśasaṃviṣakṣayevat |
adharmāntamabhedo hi gurutvaṃ ṣadkṣayosya tu ||

dharmato laghutotpādā dvaṭataḥ sa pratīyate |
sahajena malanātmā tāmravadveṣṭitoghanaṃ ||

sadīkṣāraśayogāt syācchivaḥ śulvaṃsuvarṇavat |
dahyante dhāmyamāṇānāṃ dhātūnāṃ hi yathā malāḥ ||

<69a>

tathācāpyādahepyeṣāṃ vāyubhūtomalānyalaṃ |
sa cātmavatvasaṃtāna vraśvaneṣṭa phalāvahi ||

mantracakraiḥ śivaproktaiścumbakādi sthitaiṣṭhadāḥ |
atastadaṅga me vādau sāmānya samayādikā dīkṣābījaniśaikārthaṃ 
bhūmiśodhanavadbhavet ||

pūṇyeṣu kṣetra tīrthādrivananaṃdyūṣarādiṣu |
liṅgādi sannidhau hṛdya sthāne nyatrāpi dīkṣayet ||

śaradvaṣantayodyogo dīkṣākarmavidhau varaḥ |
tayorasambhave varṣā vinānyatrāpi śasyate ||

pauṣaṃ caitraṃ tathā kintu damanārkāndu sadgrahāt |
atrā guruparvādikaṃ ca yet ||

śuklapakṣe sa ca śreṣṭha kṛṣṇapyā pañcamaṃ dinaṃ |
yoge muhūrte kendrādau bhūtyarthamati tuṣṭide ||

dīkṣādīkṣakayorbhakti sadanusrahakāriṇoḥ |
śadveśākāraśīlādi yuktayorcca dvamuktayoḥ ||

kāṃcikoṣalakacchādika kārāṣṭakaḥ hīnayoḥ |

<69b>

samyag jāti parijñānaṃ vṛttaṃ cādyāstayo guṇāḥ |
yasyaite saguḥśreṣṭo bhuktimuktiprado bhavet ||

viprasturya triṣukṣatraṃ dvayo vighrijaṃ paraṃ |
patirgṛhīrānujñātaśca niyogakṣayerhataḥ ||

sauravaiṣṇava pañcārtha sāṃkhya cauccārhatādiṣu |
śaivaḥ sarvādhikārī syāt na śaivamīkathañcanaḥ ||

devakartāranāśo vā'bhogo vā yatpratiṣṭhite |
śivatulyopi satyojyā dagdhahasto guruḥ sahi ||

śurāpānaśurīnnindyādyovālobhena dīkṣayet |
sa guruḥ sahaśiṣyaistairadvirau pacyate ciraṃ ||

yonyakupyādguruṃ mohād yogye gurukula sati |
brahmahatyādi pāpāḍhyairyuktostanarake ciraṃ ||

yatrāti vahavo lokāḥ kāle dīkṣā jighṛkṣavaḥ |
tatrādhiṣṭhānamīśasya sayameva bhavet nṛṣu ||

athācāryaḥ sarvavaittāśivaśāstraikarañjitaṃ |
sitavāsājitadvaṃdvasārghanyāsaḥ kriyā dvayaḥ ||

athāṛkanudite'prātaḥ pūjyāgandhoṅgate punaḥ |
kṛtamadhyāhnikaḥ kārya vasātkṛtyāntarambhajet ||

vṛto vinīta śiṣyeṇa svetaśraggandha vā bhuk |
vedātodyaravaiḥ śastairapraśastātirodadhat ||

vaktavyavidhinā vāstumiṣṭvāśalyādi coddharet |
duḥkhasokādihetūlyā pūryastadvamṛdātra tu ||

saptadaśasmarāhādri graharudradibhiḥ kṣaraiḥ |
samakarṇaṃ samaṃ cāru caturasraṃ caturmukhaṃ ||

sarāvairbhūṣitaṃ svate kicidvīśaplavaṃ dṛḍhaṃ |
yajñasadmati nirmāya yajet toraṇa dvārayān ||

bhūyo nityavadvā'pyadvāmātrepi nityavatmanūn |
cityasyābhyarcya dvāraikaṃ paścimaṃ vāhayan paraṃ ||

kayāṭikādibhistrīṇi yatnād dvārāṇi rodhayet |
prāgvahṛtpradakṣiṇaṃ viṣṭo vedī dakṣe sthitastataḥ ||

<70b>

nissāryā śuddhamarutaṃ kṣaṇaṃ viśramya pūrayet |
śuddhena vāyunā dehaṃ kṛtaśuddhyāditaḥ sadā ||

adhomukhaṃ hṛdaṃbhojaṃ pūrakena vikāśitaṃ |
kumbhakenonmukhī kṛtya tatrātmānaṃ nirodhayet ||

yadvādhomukhaṃ svetābjamuktalenyatra vā tataḥ |
śaivīṃ kṛtvā tanuṃ gātra (***)(?) nmudrāṃ bhajed yathā ||

hastāvadhomukhopadbhyāṃ hṛdayāntaṃ nayed budhaḥ |
tiryagmukhāntaṃ mupadi (*)(?) nmukhāgurddhayonayet ||

mahāmudreti vikhyātā dehasādhanakarmaṇi |
sarvakarmakarī caiṣā yogināṃ yogasiddhaye ||

mudaṃrātīśaviddravyaṃ mudrayetyāsajālakaṃ |
drāvayet mohayed bhaktyā mudrā'śivasamāśrayāt ||

manojāguruvaktrasthā vādbhavāmantrasambhavā |
dehodbhavāṅgaiḥ vikṣepaistridhāmudrāstrikālagāḥ ||

āvāhaneti rodhe ca visarge ceti mukhyataḥ |
etāmudrāmānaśebhyo pahāre saṃnidhyathavāṅmanoṅnaividhiyāḥ |

<71a>

dehe bhūmāvarghamātre valādau proktairaṅgairagnikārye ca sadbhiḥ ||

tatohannābhi vidvabja svapānopānarodhakaiḥ |
pūjayejjuhuyāddyāyet prāṅmukha sa naraṃ śivaṃ ||

sarvāṃ sarve na vā kuryāt pūryaṣṭaka viśuddhaye |
śabdasparśañca rūpañca rasogandhaśca pañcamaḥ ||

buddhirmanastvahaṅkāraḥ pūryaṣṭakamiti smṛtaṃ |
yata uktaṃ bahira bhrūḥ śivībhūya śivaṃ yajet ||

akṛtvā mānasaṃ yāgaṃ yo bahiryāgamācaret |
aśivastu śavijñeyo na mokṣaya vidhīyate ||

sthānaśuddhau hṛdāstreṇa gandhārghaṃ cāstra varddhanī |
kṛtvā kuryādviśeṣārghaṃ prāgvadyathā ca kīrtitaṃ ||

layabhāgāṅga sahitaṃ yāgaṃ tatraiva vinyaset |
nanvainaṃ cālayet kopi kuryādanyaṃ tathedaśaṃ ||

calārghaṃ śivakumbhāstra digpālāgnyādi pūjane |
yaśvarthe ca nirodhārghaṃ kurpyādbhāvena pūrvavat ||

<71b>

śivāgnividyāvāptyai tatkramādjñātvā trayaṃ kvacit |
gandhārghāstādakaiḥ sarva dravyānya kṣasatkuśaiḥ ||

vikiraṃ pañcagavyañca jñānāsiṃpūrvavaccaret |
uṣṇīsaṃhemavastrādi kṛtaṃ saṃhitaṃ yā labhet ||

pāśasūtra na ca guṇaṃ śaktyā sa śikhayā tataḥ |
samāṃsastvatrajāṃ śaktyā karaṇīṃ saṭīṃśitāṃ ||

mṛdīṃ sadākarāsutyāsutīkṣṇāyaḥ kriyāṃ tanuṃ |
saptāstreṇa śikhāsthenama (***) ktāñca kartarīṃ ||

haritasvetasupītāsukṛṣṇāṃ virajasāṃsyapi |
yutāni sāntyatītādyaiścaitāni mantritāni yat ||

ātmānañca yajet prāgvad vidyādehādyathāvidhiḥ |
vinyaseddaṇḍabhaṃgyai tatmuṇḍabhaṃgyā ca pañcasu ||

keṣvathāṣṭa triṃśatkalā hṛdāveśādibhiryutaiḥ |
tathā kalādi ṣaṭbhedā dhvānaṃ śukreśvare yathā ||

sāntyatītādi mūrddhādau bhuvanādhvādi ca keśādau vinyasya saṃhitā ca 
prāgvadevaṃ kumbhādiṣvapi paradīkṣāyāṃ ||

<72a>

tato gandhāvudhaute vāmāṅguṣṭha kṛtamadhyamaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kare sāśanaṃ 
śivāṃ sāṅgamabhyarcyāṃguṣṭhādiṣvīśānādītkaniṣṭhādi (*)(?) ṣi 
hṛdādīnāropyābhyacya saṃyūpyake nyasya bhūyopyaṅginaṃ śivañca |

puṣpādi sarvadravyāṇi śivahastena saṃspṛśet |
yāvitryārtha siddhimukti yogyatārtha ca nirbharaṃ ||

prāgvadvā mantrasadbhyante vikirādyabhi mantrayet |
tataḥ prāgvat kālāgnyadhaḥ sthitahūhukādi śivāntādhva śuddhyai maṇḍapaṃ 
pañcagavyāstra gandhaviśeṣārgha'nma(##?)
vikirānvighurecakātprakṣipyaśivāstraindrādiṣvivaṃ pañcagavyādi 
kṛtavimbamadhyasthaṃ ghaṭeṣu pṛthvīṃ vāstuṃ brāhmaṇadvārābhimukhīṃ 
syāmāpuṣpākṣaravarṣiṇī lakṣmīṃ ca hṛdābhyarcya 
vikirāścāmaravastrādināstreṇā hṛtyāstrārtha dhṛtvā prāgvat prāṇave 
viṣṭare vā |

<72b>

oṃ hāṃ vṛṣabhāsanāya namaḥ | iti vāsanesita sūtra kaṇṭhaṃ 
gandhagṛhavanoṣadhyādiṃ paṃṭaśrutaṃ gaṅgādyaṃ bho ratnagarbhaṃ 
pūjākṣatādi pūrṇasvarṇādi śarāvāmrādi pallavamukhamastreṇa 
prokṣavarmāṇāvaguṇṭhyaprāgvacchatāmūlālabdhaṃ śivakumbhaṃ vinyasya 
vidyādehaṃ śivatallayāṅgādhi sthitaṃ kṛtvā | taddakṣe muṣṭhyantare prāgvat 
prāṇave vā | oṃ hauṃ siṃhāsanāya namaḥ | iti vānyastāsanestrālu 
mastrātpūkṣitā dhṛtvālayāṅgena sampūjya dikpatīṃśca | oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ 
kṣauṁ kṣāṁ kṣīṁ sarvakṣetrādhipataye śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ | 
vāyuvaruṇamadhye svetaṃ raktaṃ vā dakṣe triśūlaḍamaruṃ 
vāmeśavaśiraumṛtapūrṇakapālaṃ tryakṣaṃ jaṭilaṃ kṣalantaṃ bheravākāraṃ 
kṣetrapālaṃ yajet paścādastrālu kumbhobhityalagnau prāgvatmanasā 
vā'bhrāmyānyakarestrālukāṃ nyasya ghaṭasthāne śaktyādi śaktyantāṃ 
śanaimūrtyākumbhaṃ nidhāya sāṅgaṃ śivamabhyarcyāgnyādi dikṣaṅgāni ca | 

yaddhvākārya vaśādaṣṭau saṃskārān hṛdayasya tu |
kṛtvā śiraprabhṛtīnāṃ pūjāmātraṃ samācaret ||

tato naivedyaṃ pavitraṃ japañca samarpya nāḍīmatra sandhī kṛtvā ṣaḍutthāsane 
mūrtyā'strālumāropya prāgvadbhogāṅgāni saparyanaivedyaṃ 
svamantramaṅgānāṃ ca kumbhavadvaśāṅgena japtvā nivedya | oṃ hauṁ 
śivaśaktibhyāṃ śaktiśivābhyāṃ vā nama iti bhukti muktyapekṣayo 
prāgvatsaṃspṛsya jñānāstraṃ datvā varddhanyāni śṛtaśūlāśipaṭṭigādi 
nānāśastrāstragaṇaijvaladbhinirastasamastāntarāyairāsamāptiyāgālayaṃ 
vyādhyāyet |

śivāstrabhramanānte vendrādyarcanaṃ |
kvacidrakṣārthaṃ prārthyakuṇḍabhramaḥ ||

nimittānyathajānīyā śivakumbhaniveśane | 
yadākāśāt puṣpayāto vimānasthāśca devatāḥ ||

hṛśyante saumyadṛṣṭiśca dhanurvyomnīndra rudrayoḥ |

<73b>

śikhihatsasukādīnāṃ snigdhālāyotnamodakau ||

mahān raśmivarṣañca phalaṃ siddhārtha kāya vā |
saṃkhaduṃdubhijīmūtavalkalīkāphalasvanaḥ ||

ācāryaviprarājendra nārīcchatra dhvajāyudhaṃ |
dugdhādyakṣatamālādimadhumāsādi candanaṃ ||

vṛṣasyāmbujapuṣpānāṃ dhenorddhi nyasya sanmṛdaḥ |
gajarākri dhvanisteṣāṃ darśanaṃ ratna dīpayoḥ ||

prāsādāsāravṛkṣāṇāṃ sādhūnāṃ rakṣaṇaṃ yadā |
tadāśubhaṃ syāt sarveṣāṃ madhośubhāni tadyathā ||

ulkābhūkampanirghāta ketavoṅgārakīkaśaṃ |
mahāvāyuṅgamastena dhūmanīrāhārasoṇitaṃ ||

pāṃśupātāli varṣāṃśca viruktaṃ raktavāribhiḥ |
kharoṣṭramahiṣavyālapretanagnādi rodane ||

pramādo dāruṇaḥ śabdo'śmādvādohayaṃkaliḥ |
vākpraśastaṃ śreyase syādvāk bhraṣṭaṃ varjayet sadā ||

yogaḥ kāryaśubhe hyasminna śubhepi ghṛtasya tu |
aghoraiṇa śataṃ homyaṃ phaṭkārāntena śāntaye ||

<74a>

tatogaṇaguruṇiṣṭvā vedī catuṣkoṇe dharmādīṃśca liṃge sthaṇḍile vāsaṃ 
śodhyādha śivaṃ nityavadāramatādinā sarvajñānottaroktenārcayet ||

pūrvavaktrāḥ samārabhyaḥ dakṣiṇottara paścimaṃ |
madhye caiva tu mantrajñaḥ paścādarghaṃ nivedayet ||

tatogneḥ śiṣyābhiprāyeṇa vaktrekīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt |
yathoktamaśuddheśāraśuddhaśivayoḥ saṃdhānaṃ nirākṛtya 
śrīmadgurupādaiḥ ||

yatra yatra karmaṇi yasya yasya viniyojanaṃ taduktaṃ śrila te |
muktikāmasya dīkṣāyāṃ mūrddhavaktrasya mukhyatā ||

pādalepāṃ janādīṃśca viddiṣvaṃ(?) vividhāṃścayā |
sadāśivāntagāḥ sarvājya kuryāt pūrvavaktragāḥ ||

māraṇorcāṭanādau tu vidveṣe stambhane tathā |
dakṣiṇe caiva vaktre tu homaḥ siddhi karo bhavet ||

śāntike pauṣṭike caiva saubhāgyā karṣaṇādiṣu |
bhāgyārohanasiddhau tu uttare homayet sadā ||

paścime nityakarmāṇi viniyogaḥ prakīrtita iti |

<74b>

athaikaśiṣyārthaṃ pañcaśusṛtaṃ taṇḍulādyaṃ pratiśiśumekaikavṛddhaṃ 
carunivartya śivakumbhāstrāgnītthādibhyaḥ samadhughṛtaṃ nivedya 
śiṣyāṇāṃmātmanaśca sājyaṃ cihnitaṃ sthāpayet | 

tatognau prāgvat sāṅgaṃ śivaṃ tarpayet |
rajāṃsi bhūṣaṇaṃ sarpiḥ karaṇī khaṭikāṃ tilaṃ ||

tadbhāryādīṃśca mūlādyai saṃpātenāti śodhayet |
akṛte vāstu yoge tu vāstu dehagatān surān ||

pañcādyāhutibhiḥ saṃmyak pratyekaṃ tarpayet kramāt |
bhūmeḥ parigrahe vighna śāntau caivvādhivāśane ||

nyūnāti riktedudaiśa nimittaṃ kāla śodhane |
sudeśādi prasiddhau ca deśakālādya pekṣayo ||

mūlamaghoramastraṃ vā tathā śiṣya praveśane |
śivaṃ śatādikaṃ mantrāmūpyaye dīpayed yathā ||

oṃ hauṃ śivāya svāhā || evaṃ hṛdādī nayi pūrṇāntaṃ santarpya | oṃ hūṁ 
hrauṁ śivāya hūṁ phaṭḥ | iti sarvātmādīṃśca saṃdīpyadantapūrṇaḥ 
kuṇḍapūrvagnau paścimethavā |

<75a>

vāme śivakumbhayormadhye vā'ntarvalindatvā'gnau pratyekaṃmiṣṭvā 
tarpapūrṇāndadyāt | yadvāmenu tṛpti dīptīrajo deśādi śuddhiṃ ca kṛtvā 
valirdeyaḥ vahnisthaṃ kalaśasthañca karkaristha sthaleśvaraṃ |

aṣṭapuṣpikayābhyarcya tato vijñāpayedidaṃ |
yadarthoyaṃ mahādeva bhavedyoga pravarhitaḥ ||

iti me paśavaśśāntā dvāritiṣṭhanti bhāvitāḥ |
kṛtyepyatrāhamājñapto bhavatā gurumūrtinā ||

eṣāmanugrahantasmāt māmapiṣṭhāya samprati |
karo tu bhagavāneva bhuktimukti prada prabhuḥ ||

evakūrma iti proktaṃ saṃbhāvya parameṣṭhinā |
yajecchivadātmānaṃ puṣpagandhādi bhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

mūrdhni sāktaṃ karaṃ nyasya pāratantrā parityajan |
advaitaṃ bhāvayet strīyaṃ pañcasthāna tu sāṃbhunā ||

maṇḍale sākṣibhūtohaṃ kumbhasthā yajñarakṣakaḥ |
agnāvāhuti bhoktā ca pāśasañcālakaḥ paśau ||

